{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# gl(3), L=2, adjoint⊗adjoint: overlap formula in the diagonal frame\n\nGoal: the two-site version of row 19 of `Companion-B-C-diagonalize-clean.md`, i.e. the overlap of the rotated $w$-vacuum with a diagonal-twist eigenstate written as a determinant of $Q$'s. Spec: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-01-L2-diagonal-frame-overlap-design.md`. The first code cell clears the kernel.\n\n**Conventions** (new, as in the clean L=1 notebook).\n- **Lax.** $\\mathcal L_{ij}(u)=u\\,\\delta_{ij}+h\\,E_{ij}$; two sites, $T(u)=\\mathcal L^{(1)}(u-\\theta_1)\\,\\mathcal L^{(2)}(u-\\theta_2)$ (product in auxiliary space).\n- **Twist.** Diagonal, $T^z=T\\,\\mathrm{diag}(z)$. No companion frame anywhere.\n- **Quantum minors.** Rows antisymmetrized, column $k$ at $u-(k-1)h$; $t_a=\\sum_{|I|=a}\\mathrm{qmin}_{I,I}$.\n- **Factors.** $\\nu_n(u)=\\prod_s(u-\\theta_s+h\\lambda_n)$ (the L=1 factor, multiplied over sites).\n- **Q-functions.** Direct $Q_i=z_i^{-u/h}q_i$, dual $Q^j=z_j^{+u/h}q^j$, monic $q$'s.\n\n**Numeric point** (exact rationals; 60 digits where floats enter): $h=1/2$, $\\theta=(2/7,-3/5)$, $z=(3/2,5/4,2/3)$, $w=(5/2,7/3,3/5)$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "> **EH variant (2026-10-01).** This copy of `L2-diagonal-frame-overlap.wb` uses Hermitian generators $EH_{ij}=R\\,E_{ij}R^{-1}$, with $EH_{ij}^T=EH_{ji}$ and $R=\\sqrt M=\\mathrm{diag}(1,1,1,\\sqrt2,\\sqrt6,3,2,3)$ in `ps` order. $M^{-1}E_{ij}^TM=E_{ji}$ with $M_1=1$ (cell 4). The changes from the E-basis notebook are:\n> - **Zero tests.** Surds don't cancel canonically in exact arithmetic, so exact zero tests use `zeroQ` (`PossibleZeroQ`).\n> - **$\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle$.** The hard-coded $9h^4$ is replaced by the computed value, now $9h^4R_1/R_8=3h^4$ per site.\n> - **New Section 1b.** It checks the Hermitian structure: $t_a^T$ equals the transfer matrix with the sites reversed.\n>\n> All other results are unchanged, including the value of $R$ and the 50-digit overlap formula.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* fresh kernel state; this also clears the other new-conventions notebooks' session state (their files are untouched) *)\n(* Preserve protected symbols installed by the Wolfbook extension. *)\nClearAll @@ Select[Names[\"Global`*\"], FreeQ[Attributes[#], Protected] &];\n(* GT basis and gl(3) generators, verbatim from the clean L=1 notebook *)\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\nchecks = <||>;\n(* rep, numeric point, two-site generators *)\nΛ = {2, 1, 0}; nL = 2; d1 = dim[Λ]; d2 = d1^nL; id2 = IdentityMatrix[d2];\nhN = 1/2; thN = {2/7, -3/5}; zN = {3/2, 5/4, 2/3}; wN = {5/2, 7/3, 3/5}; prec = 60;\nEe[i_, j_] := Ee[i, j] = JJ[i, j, Λ];\nE1[i_, j_] := E1[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[Ee[i, j], IdentityMatrix[d1]];\nE2[i_, j_] := E2[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[d1], Ee[i, j]];\n(* total gl(3) weight of each product basis state, in KroneckerProduct order *)\nwtBasis = Flatten[Table[Table[J0[k][p1] + J0[k][p2], {k, 3}], {p1, ps[{Λ}]}, {p2, ps[{Λ}]}], 1];\nnuP[n_][x_] := Product[x - thN[[s]] + hN Λ[[n]], {s, nL}];\nGrid[{{\"two-site dimension\", d2}, {\"weight sectors\", Length[Union[wtBasis]]}}, Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758597\" data-output-id=\"350\" data-out-n=\"690\" data-sub-idx=\"20\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"2\" data-sub-start=\"25\" data-sub-end=\"25\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[690]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHt0d28tc2l0ZSBkaW1lbnNpb259ICYgNjRcXFxobGluZVx0ZXh0e3dlaWdodCBzZWN0b3JzfSAmIDE5XFxcaGxpbmVcZW5ke2FycmF5fQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">two-site dimension</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">weight sectors</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">19</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[690]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{two-site dimension} & 64\\\\\\hline\\text{weight sectors} & 19\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
