  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* \"Hermitian\" generators EH = R.E.R^-1 (R diagonal) with EH[i,j]^T = EH[j,i]: M = R^2 solves M^-1.E[i,j]^T.M = E[j,i], normalized M_1 = 1. Overrides the cell above's Ee before anything uses it *)\nClearAll[Ee, E1, E2];\nMsolEH = Module[{Mv = Array[mm, d1]}, Mv /. First[Solve[Join[Thread[DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Table[DiagonalMatrix[Mv] . JJ[j, i, Λ] - Transpose[JJ[i, j, Λ]] . DiagonalMatrix[Mv], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]]], 0] == 0], {mm[1] == 1}], Mv]]];\nRd = Sqrt[MsolEH];\nEe[i_, j_] := Ee[i, j] = DiagonalMatrix[Rd] . JJ[i, j, Λ] . DiagonalMatrix[1/Rd];\nE1[i_, j_] := E1[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[Ee[i, j], IdentityMatrix[d1]];\nE2[i_, j_] := E2[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[d1], Ee[i, j]];\n(* exact zero test: entries now carry surds (√2, √6, ...) that Mathematica does not combine canonically (√6/2 -> √(3/2)), so === {0} can fail on true zeros; PossibleZeroQ on the distinct entries handles algebraic numbers *)\nzeroQ[e_] := AllTrue[Union[Flatten[{e}]], PossibleZeroQ];\nchecks[\"EH[i,j]^T = EH[j,i]\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[zeroQ[Transpose[Ee[i, j]] - Ee[j, i]], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]];\nGrid[{{\"R = sqrt(M)\", Rd}, {\"EH^T = EH_ji\", checks[\"EH[i,j]^T = EH[j,i]\"]}, {\"EH[1,2]\", MatrixForm[Ee[1, 2]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758597\" data-output-id=\"351\" data-out-n=\"699\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"10\" data-sub-end=\"10\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[699]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:12.2417em;vertical-align:-5.8508em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.3908em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.3508em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.3508em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:12.2017em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.8508em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.3508em;\"><span style=\"top:-12.5608em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.1172em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R = sqrt(M)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-11.3608em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.1172em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EH</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">T = EH_ji</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.8836em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.1172em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EH[1,2]</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.8508em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:12.2017em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.8508em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.3508em;\"><span style=\"top:-12.5608em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.1172em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9072em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8672em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: