  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 1b. Hermitian structure with EH\nSince $EH_{ij}^T=EH_{ji}$, transposing the physical space turns $\\mathcal L^{(s)}_{ij}$ into $\\mathcal L^{(s)}_{ji}$, and it reverses the order of the operator products. At L=1 this makes $t_a(\\mathrm{diag}\\,z)$ symmetric. At L=2 the site order in the monodromy is reversed instead: $t_a(u)^T$ is the transfer matrix of $T^{\\rm rev}(u)=\\mathcal L^{(2)}(u-\\theta_2)\\,\\mathcal L^{(1)}(u-\\theta_1)$, which is not $t_a$ itself. Both statements are checked at a sample $u$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "TmRev[v_] := TmRev[v] = Table[Sum[(KroneckerDelta[i, k] (v - thN[[2]]) id2 + hN E2[i, k]) . (KroneckerDelta[k, j] (v - thN[[1]]) id2 + hN E1[k, j]), {k, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\ntAtRev[a_, v_] := Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[Sum[TmRev[v - (k - 1) hN][[σ[[k]], l]] Zd[[l, I[[k]]]], {l, 3}], {k, a}], {σ, Permutations[I]}], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\nchecks[\"t_a(u)^T = t_a of site-reversed chain (a=1,2,3)\"] = And @@ Table[zeroQ[Transpose[tZ[[a]] /. u -> 2/9] - tAtRev[a, 2/9]], {a, 3}];\nsymL2 = Table[zeroQ[Transpose[tZ[[a]] /. u -> 2/9] - (tZ[[a]] /. u -> 2/9)], {a, 3}];\nGrid[{{\"t_a^T = t_a(reversed sites)\", checks[\"t_a(u)^T = t_a of site-reversed chain (a=1,2,3)\"]}, {\"t_a symmetric? (a=1,2,3; info only)\", symL2}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758597\" data-output-id=\"353\" data-out-n=\"717\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"7\" data-sub-start=\"4\" data-sub-end=\"4\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[717]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHt0XF9hXF57fVQgPSB0XF9hKHJldmVyc2VkIHNpdGVzKX0gJiBcbWF0aHJte1RydWV9XFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHt0XF9hIHN5bW1ldHJpYz8gKGE9MSwyLDM7IGluZm8gb25seSl9ICYgXGxlZnRce1xtYXRocm17RmFsc2V9LFxtYXRocm17RmFsc2V9LFxtYXRocm17VHJ1ZX1ccmlnaHRcfVxcXGhsaW5lXGVuZHthcnJheX0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">t_a</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">T = t_a(reversed sites)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">t_a symmetric? (a=1,2,3; info only)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:2.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
