  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. Eigenstates, one weight sector at a time\nThe diagonal twist conserves the weight, so $t_1+\\pi t_2$ (at $u=3/7$) is diagonalized block by block; the weight $\\mu$ of a state is its sector label. Eigenvalues $t_a(u)$ are read off as polynomials from one large component.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "maxc[e_, var_] := Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[e], 10^-40], var]]], 0];\nsectors = GatherBy[Range[d2], wtBasis[[#]] &];\nmixN = N[(tZ[[1]] + Pi tZ[[2]]) /. u -> 3/7, prec];\nstates = Flatten[Table[With[{es = Eigensystem[mixN[[sec, sec]]]}, Table[<|\"mu\" -> wtBasis[[sec[[1]]]], \"ev\" -> es[[1, r]], \"vec\" -> Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> es[[2, r]]], {d2}]]|>, {r, Length[sec]}]], {sec, sectors}], 1];\nnS = Length[states]; muS = states[[All, \"mu\"]]; vecS = states[[All, \"vec\"]];\ntZn = N[tZ, prec];\nvals = Table[With[{k = Ordering[Abs[ψ], -1][[1]]}, Table[Chop[Expand[(tZn[[a]] . ψ)[[k]]/ψ[[k]]], 10^-40], {a, 3}]], {ψ, vecS}];\nchecks[\"64 eigenvectors of t1,t2,t3 (max residual)\"] = Max[Table[maxc[tZn[[a]] . vecS[[A]] - vals[[A, a]] vecS[[A]], u], {A, nS}, {a, 3}]];\nchecks[\"simple spectrum within sectors (min gap)\"] = Min[Table[With[{e = Select[states, #[\"mu\"] === mu &][[All, \"ev\"]]}, If[Length[e] < 2, Infinity, Min[Abs[Subtract @@@ Subsets[e, {2}]]]]], {mu, Union[muS]}]];\nGrid[{{\"states\", nS}, {\"sector sizes\", Tally[Length /@ sectors]}, {\"max residual\", checks[\"64 eigenvectors of t1,t2,t3 (max residual)\"]}, {\"min gap\", N[checks[\"simple spectrum within sectors (min gap)\"], 5]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758597\" data-output-id=\"354\" data-out-n=\"727\" data-sub-idx=\"9\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"9\" data-sub-start=\"9\" data-sub-end=\"9\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[727]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHtzdGF0ZXN9ICYgNjRcXFxobGluZVx0ZXh0e3NlY3RvciBzaXplc30gJiBcYmVnaW57cG1hdHJpeH0xICYgNlxcMiAmIDZcXDYgJiA2XFwxMCAmIDFcZW5ke3BtYXRyaXh9XFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHttYXggcmVzaWR1YWx9ICYgMFxcXGhsaW5lXHRleHR7bWluIGdhcH0gJiAwLjAwMzIxODJcXFxobGluZVxlbmR7YXJyYXl9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.44em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">states</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sector sizes</span></s