   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 8. Identifying $R$\nAt L=1 (row 19), $R=(\\Omega\\cdot y_0)/(c_0\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle\\,\\Phi_Q^{\\rm vac}(y_0))$. The L=2 candidates, each built site by site:\n- **$y_0$.** $|y_0^{(2)}\\rangle=|y_0(\\theta_1)\\rangle\\otimes|y_0(\\theta_2)\\rangle$. Each factor is the L=1 vector at that site: in the companion frame $y_0=t_{S,21}(\\theta)\\,t_{S,20}(\\theta)\\,t_1(\\theta)^{-1}e_8$, with $t_{S,20}(\\theta)=t_1(\\theta-h)t_1(\\theta)-t_2(\\theta)$ and $t_{S,21}(\\theta)=t_2(\\theta+h)t_1(\\theta-h)-t_3(\\theta+h)$. It is mapped to the diagonal frame by $P_{\\rm phys}$.\n- **$\\Phi_Q(y_0)$.** $\\Phi_Q(y_0)=\\prod_s[Q_1(\\theta_s-2h)Q_2(\\theta_s)-Q_2(\\theta_s-2h)Q_1(\\theta_s)]\\,Q_1(\\theta_s-2h)$, from the vacuum's direct $Q$'s.\n- **$c_0$.** The coefficient of the monomials of $\\Psi_Q(x_0)\\Phi_Q(y_0)$ in the per-ladder $\\det N$, with the $Q$'s at $\\theta_s+kh$ treated as symbols. Every symbol not in that product is set to 0 first, which leaves those coefficients unchanged.\n- **$\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle$.** The candidate is $\\langle x_0^{(2)}|y_0^{(2)}\\rangle=(9h^4)^2$. It is not obvious that this is what enters at L=2: at L=1 it was really the $(y_0,x_0)$ entry of the inverse $x/y$ overlap matrix.\n\nThe cell reports $R$ divided by the prediction.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* one-site companion-frame t_a at site s, twist Gc[zN] *)\nT1s[s_][v_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, k] (v - thN[[s]]) IdentityMatrix[d1] + hN Ee[i, k], {i, 3}, {k, 3}];\nGz = Gc[zN];\nTG1[s_][i_, j_][v_] := Sum[T1s[s][v][[i, l]] Gz[[l, j]], {l, 3}];\nt1s[s_, a_, v_] := Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[TG1[s][σ[[k]], I[[k]]][v - (k - 1) hN], {k, a}], {σ, Permutations[I]}], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\ny0comp[s_] := With[{θs = thN[[s]]}, (t1s[s, 2, θs + hN] . t1s[s, 1, θs - hN] - t1s[s, 3, θs + hN]) . (t1s[s, 1, θs - hN] . t1s[s, 1, θs] - t1s[s, 2, θs]) . Inverse[t1s[s, 1, θs]] . UnitVector[d1, d1]];\ny0d = Table[Pph1 . y0comp[s], {s, nL}];\n(* <x0|y0> per site: 9h^4 in the E basis, times R1/R8 in the EH basis (the seeds e1, e8 are the same GT states) *)\nx0y0s = Table[x01 . y0d[[s]], {s, nL}];\nchecks[\"L=1: <x0|y0> = 9h^4 R1/R8 at each site (diagonal frame)\"] = zeroQ[x0y0s - ConstantArray[9 hN^4 Rd[[1]]/Rd[[d1]], nL]];\ny02 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[y0d[[1]], y0d[[2]]]];\nphiQvac = Product[With[{t = thN[[s]]}, (QD[\"vac\", 1, t - 2 hN] QD[\"vac\", 2, t] - QD[\"vac\", 2, t - 2 hN] QD[\"vac\", 1, t]) QD[\"vac\", 1, t - 2 hN]], {s, nL}];\n(* c0: per-ladder det N with symbols Us[j,s,k] = Q^j(θ_s+kh) (ket dual), Ds[i,s,k] = Q_i(θ_s+kh) (bra direct) *)\nrowSa[{i_, j_}, α_] := Sum[wgt[p] With[{x = xP[p], n = p[[2]]}, {-Us[j, α, -n] Ds[i, α, -n], -x Us[j, α, -n] Ds[i, α, -n], Us[j, α, -n] Ds[i, α, -n + 1], x Us[j, α, -n] Ds[i, α, -n + 1], Us[j, α, -n - 1] Ds[i, α, -n], x Us[j, α, -n - 1] Ds[i, α, -n]}], {p, Select[poles, #[[1]] == α &]}];\ntermSym = Expand[Product[(Us[2, s, -2] Us[3, s, -3] - Us[3, s, -2] Us[2, s, -3]) Us[3, s, -1] (Ds[1, s, -2] Ds[2, s, 0] - Ds[2, s, -2] Ds[1, s, 0]) Ds[1, s, -2], {s, nL}]];\nkeepVars = Union[Cases[termSym, (Us | Ds)[__], Infinity]];\ndetSym = Expand[Det[Flatten[Table[rowSa[ij, α], {α, nL}, {ij, prsL1}], 1]] /. (v : (Us | Ds)[__] /; ! MemberQ[keepVars, v]) -> 0];\nmonos = List @@ termSym; coefOf[m_] := With[{bare = m /. (Us | Ds)[__] -> 1}, Coefficient[detSym, m/bare]/bare];\nc0List = coefOf /@ monos; c02 = First[c0List];\nchecks[\"c0: same coefficient on all (x0,y0) monomials\"] = Union[c0List - c02] === {0};\nRpred = (Ω2 . y02)/(c02 (Times @@ x0y0s) phiQvac);\nGrid[{{\"<x0|y0> per site\", x0y0s}, {\"# monomials, all same coefficient\", {Length[monos], checks[\"c0: same coefficient on all (x0,y0) monomials\"]}}, {\"c0 (L=2)\", c02}, {\"c0 × h^12\", c02 hN^12}, {\"Ω·y0\", N[Ω2 . y02, 10]}, {\"R (fitted)\", N[RBa[[1]], 12]}, {\"R / Rpred\", N[RBa[[1]]/Rpred, 15]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"189\" data-out-n=\"1709\" data-sub-idx=\"21\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"22\" data-sub-start=\"21\" data-sub-end=\"21\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1709]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div data-wolfram-is-skeleton=\"1\" data-wolfram-atom-count=\"2743\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:16.9618em;vertical-align:-8.2109em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.7509em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.7109em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.7109em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:16.9218em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-8.2109em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.7109em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.7109em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.1615em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;x0|y0&gt; per site</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.3208em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.1615em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># monomials, all same coefficient</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.1157em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.1615em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"