  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 10. Acting on $\\langle\\Omega|$ with $T_{(1,1)}$ and $T_{(2,1)}$ at $\\theta_1-2h$: is the action localized on site 1?\nThe transfer matrices are built with the **ket's diagonal twist** $\\mathrm{diag}(z_1,z_2,z_3)$, so that $\\langle\\Omega|T_\\lambda(u)|\\Psi_B\\rangle=T_\\lambda^B(u)\\,\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi_B\\rangle$. Fusion uses the CBR formula of the clean L=1 notebook, $T_\\lambda(u)=\\det_{i,j\\le\\lambda_1}t_{\\lambda'_j+i-j}(u+(i-1)h)$:\n$$T_{(1,1)}(u)=t_2(u),\\qquad T_{(2,1)}(u)=t_2(u)\\,t_1(u+h)-t_3(u+h).$$\n**Localization test.** Write a covector $c$ on $V\\otimes V$ as an $8\\times8$ matrix $M_{i_1i_2}$ (row = site 1, column = site 2). The action is localized on site 1 when $\\langle\\Omega|T_\\lambda(\\theta_1-2h)=\\langle v_\\lambda|\\otimes\\langle\\Omega_{zw}|$, i.e. $M=v_\\lambda\\,\\Omega_{zw}^T$. It is *nontrivial* when $v_\\lambda\\not\\propto\\Omega_{zw}$; otherwise $\\langle\\Omega|$ would simply be an eigencovector. The cell also compares $v_\\lambda$ with the one-site action $\\langle\\Omega_{zw}|T^{L=1,\\,\\theta_1}_\\lambda(\\theta_1-2h)$ (same twist), reported for information only.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* CBR fusion with the KET's twist diag(z): T_(1,1)(u) = t2(u), T_(2,1)(u) = t2(u) t1(u+h) - t3(u+h); covector-times-matrix only, no 64x64 products *)\nuL = thN[[1]] - 2 hN;\ntZat[a_, v_] := tZ[[a]] /. u -> v;\nΩT[\"11\"] = Ω2 . tZat[2, uL];\nΩT[\"21\"] = ΩT[\"11\"] . tZat[1, uL + hN] - Ω2 . tZat[3, uL + hN];\n(* Ω2 = Flatten[Ω1 ⊗ Ω1], so Partition gives rows = site-1 index, columns = site-2 index; site-1-local <=> M = v Ω1^T *)\nasMat[c_] := Partition[c, d1];\nlocV[c_] := asMat[c] . Ω1/(Ω1 . Ω1);\nlocResid[c_] := asMat[c] - Outer[Times, locV[c], Ω1];\nvL = <|\"11\" -> locV[ΩT[\"11\"]], \"21\" -> locV[ΩT[\"21\"]]|>;\nchecks[\"<Ω|T_(1,1)(θ1-2h) = <v|⊗<Ωzw| (site-1 local, exact)\"] = zeroQ[locResid[ΩT[\"11\"]]];\nchecks[\"<Ω|T_(2,1)(θ1-2h) = <v|⊗<Ωzw| (site-1 local, exact)\"] = zeroQ[locResid[ΩT[\"21\"]]];\n(* nontrivial: v not ∝ Ω1 (rank 2), and nonzero *)\nnontriv[k_] := MatrixRank[N[{vL[k], Ω1}, prec]] == 2;\n(* contrast: the same covector is NOT local on site 2 (columns ∝ Ω1 would mean M = Ω1 v^T) *)\nloc2Q[c_] := zeroQ[Transpose[asMat[c]] - Outer[Times, Transpose[asMat[c]] . Ω1/(Ω1 . Ω1), Ω1]];\n(* info: one-site chain at θ1 with the same twist, T^{L=1}_λ(θ1-2h) *)\nT1z[v_] := Table[(KroneckerDelta[i, k] (v - thN[[1]]) IdentityMatrix[d1] + hN Ee[i, k]) zN[[k]], {i, 3}, {k, 3}];\nt1site[a_, v_] := Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[T1z[v - (k - 1) hN][[σ[[k]], I[[k]]]], {k, a}], {σ, Permutations[I]}], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\nw1[\"11\"] = Ω1 . t1site[2, uL];\nw1[\"21\"] = (Ω1 . t1site[2, uL]) . t1site[1, uL + hN] - Ω1 . t1site[3, uL + hN];\nparQ[a_, b_] := MatrixRank[N[{a, b}, prec]] == 1;\nratio[a_, b_] := With[{k = Ordering[Abs[N[b]], -1][[1]]}, a[[k]]/b[[k]]];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{k, checks[\"<Ω|T_(\" <> StringJoin[Riffle[Characters[k], \",\"]] <> \")(θ1-2h) = <v|⊗<Ωzw| (site-1 local, exact)\"], nontriv[k], loc2Q[ΩT[k]], parQ[vL[k], w1[k]], If[parQ[vL[k], w1[k]], Simplify[ratio[vL[k], w1[k]]], \"-\"]}, {k, {\"11\", \"21\"}}], {\"λ\", \"site-1 local\", \"v ∦ Ωzw (nontrivial)\", \"also site-2 local?\", \"v ∥ Ωzw·T^{L=1}_λ ?\", \"ratio v / (Ωzw·T^{L=1}_λ)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
