  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* site-2 spectator factor: v_λ = f_λ · Ωzw.T^{L=1,θ1}_λ(θ1-2h). Fitted shapes in θ12 = θ1-θ2 (one numeric point only, so this is a guess consistent with it): f_(1,1) = (θ12-h)(θ12-3h), f_(2,1) = (θ12-h)^2(θ12-3h) *)\nθ12 = thN[[1]] - thN[[2]];\nfL[\"11\"] = (θ12 - hN) (θ12 - 3 hN); fL[\"21\"] = (θ12 - hN)^2 (θ12 - 3 hN);\nchecks[\"<Ω|T_(1,1)(θ1-2h) = (θ12-h)(θ12-3h) · (Ωzw.T^{L=1}_(1,1)) ⊗ Ωzw\"] = zeroQ[ΩT[\"11\"] - fL[\"11\"] Flatten[KroneckerProduct[w1[\"11\"], Ω1]]];\nchecks[\"<Ω|T_(2,1)(θ1-2h) = (θ12-h)^2(θ12-3h) · (Ωzw.T^{L=1}_(2,1)) ⊗ Ωzw\"] = zeroQ[ΩT[\"21\"] - fL[\"21\"] Flatten[KroneckerProduct[w1[\"21\"], Ω1]]];\nGrid[{{\"λ\", \"f_λ (exact)\", \"factorized formula holds\"}, {\"(1,1)\", fL[\"11\"], checks[\"<Ω|T_(1,1)(θ1-2h) = (θ12-h)(θ12-3h) · (Ωzw.T^{L=1}_(1,1)) ⊗ Ωzw\"]}, {\"(2,1)\", fL[\"21\"], checks[\"<Ω|T_(2,1)(θ1-2h) = (θ12-h)^2(θ12-3h) · (Ωzw.T^{L=1}_(2,1)) ⊗ Ωzw\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
