span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">343000</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">31347</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5551em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6102em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.5551em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0551em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.2151em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">factorized formula holds</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.8049em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5551em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6102em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.5551em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.0551em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7051em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.0551em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.0551em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.0551em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5551em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1892]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline\\lambda  & \\text{f\\_$\\lambda$ (exact)} & \\text{factorized formula holds}\\\\\\hline\\text{(1,1)} & -\\frac{1161}{4900} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{(2,1)} & -\\frac{31347}{343000} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "59bbc768-3399-4cc1-9774-c3f3a0546fff"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result (exact, one numeric point).** With $T_\\lambda$ built from the ket's twist $\\mathrm{diag}(z)$, both covectors are localized on site 1 and the action is nontrivial ($v_\\lambda\\not\\propto\\Omega_{zw}$). They are not local on site 2. Site 1 sees exactly the one-site transfer matrix at $\\theta_1$, and site 2 only contributes a scalar:\n$$\\langle\\Omega|T_{(1,1)}(\\theta_1-2h)=(\\theta_{12}-h)(\\theta_{12}-3h)\\;\\langle\\Omega_{zw}|T^{L=1,\\theta_1}_{(1,1)}(\\theta_1-2h)\\otimes\\langle\\Omega_{zw}|,$$\n$$\\langle\\Omega|T_{(2,1)}(\\theta_1-2h)=(\\theta_{12}-h)^2(\\theta_{12}-3h)\\;\\langle\\Omega_{zw}|T^{L=1,\\theta_1}_{(2,1)}(\\theta_1-2h)\\otimes\\langle\\Omega_{zw}|.$$\nThe factors $f_\\lambda$ were fitted at the single point $h=1/2$, $\\theta_{12}=31/35$; a second point is needed to confirm them. Because $\\langle\\Omega|T_\\lambda|\\Psi_B\\rangle=T^B_\\lambda(\\theta_1-2h)\\,\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi_B\\rangle$, this gives the overlaps $(\\langle v_\\lambda|\\otimes\\langle\\Omega_{zw}|)\\,|\\Psi_B\\rangle$ in terms of the known $\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi_B\\rangle$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 10b. Undoing the global rotation on site 1: $\\langle v_\\lambda|R^{-1}$\n$\\Omega_{zw}=e_1^TR$ with $R=e^{r_1E_{12}}e^{r_2E_{13}}e^{r_3E_{23}}$ (raising operators, Section 4). Here $\\langle v_\\lambda|=\\langle\\Omega_{zw}|T^{L=1,\\theta_1}_\\lambda(\\theta_1-2h)$ is the one-site vector from Section 10, without the site-2 factor $f_\\lambda$. The cell lists the GT components of $\\langle v_\\lambda|R^{-1}$ with their weights. It also tests whether $R^{-1}$ can be moved into the auxiliary space, i.e. $\\langle v_\\lambda|R^{-1}=e_1^T\\,T_\\lambda^{L=1}[g\\,\\mathrm{diag}(z)\\,g^{-1}](\\theta_1-2h)$ for $g=R$ written in the fundamental (or its inverse).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Rg = MatrixExp[(r1 /. rOm) Ee[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[(r2 /. rOm) Ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[(r3 /. rOm) Ee[2, 3]];\nRgInv = MatrixExp[-(r3 /. rOm) Ee[2, 3]] . MatrixExp[-(r2 /. rOm) Ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[-(r1 /. rOm) Ee[1, 2]];\nchecks[\"Ωzw = e1^T R, R R^-1 = 1\"] = zeroQ[Ω1 - UnitVector[d1, 1] . Rg] && zeroQ[Rg . RgInv - IdentityMatrix[d1]];\nvR[k_] := vR[k] = Simplify[w1[k] . RgInv];\nwts = Table[Table[J0[kk][p], {kk, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}];\n(* one-site T_λ at θ1 with an arbitrary 3x3 twist M on the right (aux-space product written out: a 3x3 array of 8x8 blocks) *)\nT1M[M_][v_] := Table[Sum[(KroneckerDelta[i, l] (v - thN[[1]]) IdentityMatrix[d1] + hN Ee[i, l]) M[[l, k]], {l, 3}], {i, 3}, {k, 3}];\nt1M[M_, a_, v_] := Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[T1M[M][v - (k - 1) hN][[σ[[k]], I[[k]]]], {k, a}], {σ, Permutations[I]}], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\nTλM[\"11\"][M_] := t1M[M, 2, uL]; TλM[\"21\"][M_] := t1M[M, 2, uL] . t1M[M, 1, uL + hN] - t1M[M, 3, uL + hN];\nchecks[\"one-site helper reproduces w1 at twist diag(z)\"] = zeroQ[w1[\"21\"] - Ω1 . TλM[\"21\"][DiagonalMatrix[zN]]];\n(* R in the fundamental. ℒ = u + h Σ e_ij⊗E_ij is invariant under g^-T ⊗ π(g), so R^-1 should move into the aux twist as g^-T z g^T, not g z g^-1 *)\ngF = MatrixExp[(r1 /. rOm) ee[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[(r2 /. rOm) ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[(r3 /. rOm) ee[2, 3]];\nconjQ[k_, g_] := zeroQ[vR[k] - UnitVector[d1, 1] . TλM[k][g . DiagonalMatrix[zN] . Inverse[g]]];\ngTi = Inverse[Transpose[gF]];\nchecks[\"<v_(1,1)|R^-1 = e1^T T_(1,1)[g^-T z g^T](θ1-2h)\"] = conjQ[\"11\", gTi];\nchecks[\"<v_(2,1)|R^-1 = e1^T T_(2,1)[g^-T z g^T](θ1-2h)\"] = conjQ[\"21\", gTi];\nGrid[Join[{{\"GT pattern\", \"weight\", \"<v_(1,1)|R^-1\", \"<v_(2,1)|R^-1\"}}, Table[{ps[{Λ}][[n]], wts[[n]], vR[\"11\"][[n]], vR[\"21\"][[n]]}, {n, d1}],\n  {{\"helper check\", \"\", checks[\"one-site helper reproduces w1 at twist diag(z)\"], \"\"},\n   {\"twist g z g^-1 (g = R_fund)\", \"\", conjQ[\"11\", gF], conjQ[\"21\", gF]},\n   {\"twist g^-1 z g\", \"\", conjQ[\"11\", Inverse[gF]], conjQ[\"21\", Inverse[gF]]},\n   {\"twist g^T z g^-T\", \"\", conjQ[\"11\", Transpose[gF]], conjQ[\"21\", Transpose[gF]]},\n   {\"twist g^-T z g^T\", \"\", checks[\"<v_(1,1)|R^-1 = e1^T T_(1,1)[g^-T z g^T](θ1-2h)\"], checks[\"<v_(2,1)|R^-1 = e1^T T_(2,1)[g^-T z g^T](θ1-2h)\"]}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"208\" data-out-n=\"1930\" data-sub-idx=\"16\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"32\" data-sub-start=\"16\" data-sub-end=\"21\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1930]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:17.2369em;vertical-align:-8.3484em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.8884em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.8484em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:10.8484em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:17.1969em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-8.3484em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:8.8484em;\"><span style=\"top:-11.0084em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GT pattern</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.8033em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\">