  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* multiplicity-2 irrep [3,2,1]: do the λ=(1,1) and λ=(2,1) projections span both copies? *)\nchecks[\"[3,2,1]: (1,1) and (2,1) HW projections independent (rank 2)\"] = MatrixRank[{hwOv[\"11\", {3, 2, 1}], hwOv[\"21\", {3, 2, 1}]}] == 2;\nchecks[\"(2,1) reaches every irrep of [2,1,0]^2\"] = AllTrue[irreps, ! zeroQ[hwOv[\"21\", #]] &];\nGrid[{{\"[3,2,1] rank 2\", checks[\"[3,2,1]: (1,1) and (2,1) HW projections independent (rank 2)\"]}, {\"(2,1) reaches all irreps\", checks[\"(2,1) reaches every irrep of [2,1,0]^2\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
