  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* symbolic HW projections of <v_λ|R^-1 ⊗ e1^T, same orthonormal HW kets as 10c (they are pure numbers) *)\ncCovS[k_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct[vRS[k], UnitVector[d1, 1]]];\nhwOvS[k_, μ_] := hwOvS[k, μ] = Factor[Together[cCovS[k] . # & /@ hwBasis[μ]]];\nchecks[\"symbolic HW projections = numeric 10c at the point\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[zeroQ[(hwOvS[k, μ] /. numPt) - hwOv[k, μ]], {k, {\"11\", \"21\"}}, {μ, irreps}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"λ = (1,1)\", \"λ = (2,1)\"}}, Table[{μ, hwOvS[\"11\", μ], hwOvS[\"21\", μ]}, {μ, Reverse[irreps]}], {{\"matches numeric 10c\", checks[\"symbolic HW projections = numeric 10c at the point\"], \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
