  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 11. Small-twist limit of the overlap ratio $\\rho_B=\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi_B\\rangle/(\\langle\\Omega|y_0\\rangle\\langle x_0|\\Psi_B\\rangle)$\nBy Sections 7–9, $\\rho_B=\\det N[B,\\mathrm{vac}]/(c_0\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle^2\\Phi_Q^{\\rm vac}(y_0)\\Psi_Q^B(x_0))$; it does not depend on the normalization of $\\Psi_B$. Take $z_k=e^{\\varepsilon\\phi_k}$ and $w_k=e^{\\varepsilon\\omega_k}$, and send $\\varepsilon\\to0$. Only states $\\Psi_B$ whose limit is a highest-weight state are kept: one per dominant weight sector $\\mu=\\Lambda$, two in $(3,2,1)$. A state counts as HW when $\\|E^{\\rm tot}_{12}\\Psi\\|+\\|E^{\\rm tot}_{23}\\Psi\\|=O(\\varepsilon)$.\n\nThe ratio is computed **directly from the vectors**: eigenstates of the $z$-twisted chain, $\\Omega=\\Omega_{zw}^{\\otimes2}$, $x_0=(e_1^TP_{\\rm phys}^{-1})^{\\otimes2}$ and $y_0=\\otimes_sP_{\\rm phys}\\,y_0^{\\rm comp}(\\theta_s)$, all rebuilt at each $\\varepsilon$. The point is the same as before ($h=1/2$, $\\theta=(2/7,-3/5)$). The leading power $\\#$ is read off from two values of $\\varepsilon$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* everything at one ε, numerically at precision pr; P_phys, y0 and Ω rebuilt with z = e^{εφ}, w = e^{εω} *)\nEtotS[i_, j_] := EtotS[i, j] = E1[i, j] + E2[i, j];\nhwSecs = {{4, 2, 0}, {4, 1, 1}, {3, 3, 0}, {3, 2, 1}, {2, 2, 2}};\nnexpS[A_] := IdentityMatrix[Length[A]] + Sum[MatrixPower[A, k]/k!, {k, 1, 4}];\n(* numeric EH generators for the one-site y0 Lax: exact surd combinations that cancel to 0 make N[] fail with meprec at some (h, θ) *)\nEeN[i_, j_] := EeN[i, j] = N[Ee[i, j], 400];\nT1sE[s_][v_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, k] (v - thN[[s]]) IdentityMatrix[d1] + hN EeN[i, k], {i, 3}, {k, 3}];\nt1sE[s_, a_, v_, Gm_] := Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[Sum[T1sE[s][v - (k - 1) hN][[σ[[k]], l]] Gm[[l, I[[k]]]], {l, 3}], {k, a}], {σ, Permutations[I]}], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\ny0E[s_, Gm_] := With[{θs = thN[[s]]}, (t1sE[s, 2, θs + hN, Gm] . t1sE[s, 1, θs - hN, Gm] - t1sE[s, 3, θs + hN, Gm]) . (t1sE[s, 1, θs - hN, Gm] . t1sE[s, 1, θs, Gm] - t1sE[s, 2, θs, Gm]) . Inverse[t1sE[s, 1, θs, Gm]] . UnitVector[d1, d1]];\nrOmF[zz_, ww_] := {(ww[[1]] - zz[[1]])/(ww[[1]] - zz[[2]]), ((ww[[1]] - zz[[1]]) (-ww[[2]] + zz[[1]]) (zz[[2]] - zz[[3]]))/((zz[[1]] - zz[[2]]) (ww[[1]] - zz[[3]]) (ww[[2]] - zz[[3]])), ((ww[[1]] - zz[[2]]) (-ww[[2]] + zz[[2]]) (zz[[1]] - zz[[3]]))/((zz[[1]] - zz[[2]]) (ww[[1]] - zz[[3]]) (-ww[[2]] + zz[[3]]))};\n(* \"ev\" = eigenvalue of t1 + π t2 at u = 3/7; unlike t1(0) it separates the two [3,2,1] copies *)\nsmallTw[eps_, φv_, ωv_, pr_] := Module[{zE, wE, tt, mix, rsE, Pph, x01e, x02e, y02e, rr, Om1, Om2, Oy, sts},\n  zE = N[Exp[eps φv], pr]; wE = N[Exp[eps ωv], pr];\n  tt = Table[tPoly[DiagonalMatrix[zE], a], {a, 2}];\n  mix = (tt[[1]] + N[Pi, pr] tt[[2]]) /. u -> 3/7;\n  rsE = rsSol /. Thread[zs -> zE];\n  Pph = nexpS[(r[1] /. rsE) Ee[3, 2]] . nexpS[(r[2] /. rsE) Ee[3, 1]] . nexpS[(r[3] /. rsE) Ee[2, 1]] . DiagonalMatrix[Table[Product[(s[k] /. rsE)^J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}]] . nexpS[(1/zE[[1]]) Ee[1, 2]] . nexpS[-(1/(zE[[1]] zE[[2]])) Ee[1, 3]] . nexpS[((zE[[1]] + zE[[2]])/(zE[[1]] zE[[2]])) Ee[2, 3]];\n  x01e = UnitVector[d1, 1] . Inverse[Pph]; x02e = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[x01e, x01e]];\n  y02e = Flatten[KroneckerProduct @@ Table[Pph . y0E[s, Gc[zE]], {s, nL}]];\n  rr = rOmF[zE, wE];\n  Om1 = UnitVector[d1, 1] . nexpS[rr[[1]] Ee[1, 2]] . nexpS[rr[[2]] Ee[1, 3]] . nexpS[rr[[3]] Ee[2, 3]]; Om2 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Om1, Om1]];\n  Oy = Om2 . y02e;\n  sts = Flatten[Table[With[{sec = Flatten[Position[wtBasis, Λw]]}, With[{es = Eigensystem[mix[[sec, sec]]]}, Table[With[{ψ = Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> es[[2, k]]], {d2}]]},\n        <|\"mu\" -> Λw, \"ev\" -> es[[1, k]], \"t1\" -> Chop[(tt[[1]] /. u -> 0) . ψ, 10^-30][[Ordering[Abs[ψ], -1][[1]]]]/ψ[[Ordering[Abs[ψ], -1][[1]]]], \"hwRes\" -> (Norm[EtotS[1, 2] . ψ] + Norm[EtotS[2, 3] . ψ])/Norm[ψ], \"Ωψ/x0ψ\" -> (Om2 . ψ)/(x02e . ψ), \"ρ\" -> (Om2 . ψ)/(Oy (x02e . ψ))|>], {k, Length[sec]}]]], {Λw, hwSecs}], 1];\n  <|\"Ωy0\" -> Oy, \"x0y0\" -> x02e . y02e, \"states\" -> sts|>];\nφT = {1/3, -2/7, 5/11}; ωT = {2/5, 1/7, -3/4};\n{tst, st1} = AbsoluteTiming[smallTw[10^-6, φT, ωT, 80]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"time (s)\", tst, \"\", \"\"}, {\"μ\", \"hw residual\", \"t1(0)\", \"ρ\"}}, Table[{s[\"mu\"], N[s[\"hwRes\"], 3], N[s[\"t1\"], 6], N[s[\"ρ\"], 6]}, {s, st1[\"states\"]}]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
