yle=\"top:-7.31em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.655em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.51em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.655em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.71em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.655em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.655em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.655em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-13.31em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.655em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.155em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
