  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* constants: X_B = <x0|y0>^2 · C_B / ∏(ω_i-φ_j)^{n_ij}, functions of t = θ12/h only (read off at two chain points):\n   27, 10, 10bar: X = 1;  singlet: X = -8/(t^2-1);  octets: roots of X^2 - (4/t^2) X - 5/t^2, i.e. X± = (2 ± Sqrt[4+5t^2])/t^2.\n   Second chain point: temporarily swap h, θ, drop the memoized monodromy, then restore *)\nXpred[h_, th_] := With[{t = (th[[1]] - th[[2]])/h}, Join[{1, 1, 1}, Sort[(2 + {-1, 1} Sqrt[4 + 5 t^2])/t^2], {-8/(t^2 - 1)}]];\nXat[pts_] := Table[With[{c = leadC @@ p}, (3 hN^4)^2 c/Table[Times @@ ((facs @@ p)^nExp[[b]]), {b, 6}]], {p, pts}];\nclearTm[] := (DownValues[Tm] = Select[DownValues[Tm], ! FreeQ[#[[1]], Pattern] &]);\nX1 = Xat[fitPts[[1 ;; 3]]];\n{hSave, thSave} = {hN, thN}; hN = 1/3; thN = {1/5, -4/9}; clearTm[];\nX2 = Check[Xat[fitPts[[4 ;; 6]]], $Failed];\nX2pred = Xpred[hN, thN];\nhN = hSave; thN = thSave; clearTm[];\nX1pred = Xpred[hN, thN];\n(* octet order: leadC sorts by Re ev; compare as sorted pairs *)\nsortOct[x_] := Join[x[[1 ;; 3]], Sort[Re[x[[4 ;; 5]]]], x[[6 ;;]]];\ndevX1 = Max[Abs[sortOct[#] - X1pred] & /@ X1]; devX2 = Max[Abs[sortOct[#] - X2pred] & /@ X2];\nchecks[\"ε→0: X_B closed forms at main point\"] = devX1; checks[\"ε→0: X_B closed forms at 2nd point (h=1/3, θ=(1/5,-4/9))\"] = devX2;\nGrid[{{\"point\", \"X predicted (27,10,10bar,8-,8+,1)\", \"max |X - pred| over 3 (φ,ω)\"}, {\"h=1/2, θ=(2/7,-3/5)\", N[X1pred, 8], ScientificForm[N[devX1, 3], 3]}, {\"h=1/3, θ=(1/5,-4/9)\", N[X2pred, 8], ScientificForm[N[devX2, 3], 3]}, {\"restored\", {hN, thN}, \"\"}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
