ass=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.155em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.81em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.155em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.655em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.71em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.655em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.655em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.655em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.31em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.655em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.155em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[2256]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{point} & \\text{X predicted (27,10,10bar,8-,8+,1)} & \\text{max |X - pred| over 3 ($\\varphi$,$\\omega$)}\\\\\\hline\\text{h=1/2, $\\theta$=(2/7,-3/5)} & \\left\\{1.\\,,1.\\,,1.\\,,-0.77672092,2.0514348,-3.7418862\\right\\} & \\text{3.11}\\times 10^{\\text{-13}}\\\\\\hline\\text{h=1/3, $\\theta$=(1/5,-4/9)} & \\left\\{1.\\,,1.\\,,1.\\,,-0.73928566,1.8094402,-2.9220779\\right\\} & \\text{1.44}\\times 10^{\\text{-13}}\\\\\\hline\\text{restored} & \\left\\{\\frac{1}{2},\\left\\{\\frac{2}{7},-\\frac{3}{5}\\right\\}\\right\\} & \\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "32784d9f-4a98-4b88-9346-aa7a3e527b88"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result (Section 11; numeric, high precision; HW-limit states of $[2,1,0]^{\\otimes2}$).** With $z_k=e^{\\varepsilon\\phi_k}$, $w_k=e^{\\varepsilon\\omega_k}$ and $t=\\theta_{12}/h$:\n$$\\lim_{\\varepsilon\\to0}\\varepsilon^{-\\#}\\,\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle^2\\,\\frac{\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi_B\\rangle}{\\langle\\Omega|y_0\\rangle\\langle x_0|\\Psi_B\\rangle}=X_B\\prod_{i,j}(\\omega_i-\\phi_j)^{n_{ij}},\\qquad n_{ij}=\\max(d_j-D_i,0).$$\n- $d_j=2\\lambda_1-\\mu_j=\\deg q_j$ are the twisted direct degrees of $\\Psi_B$, and $D_i=(0,2,4)$ those of the $w$-vacuum. So $\\#=\\sum_{ij}n_{ij}=6+\\sum_j\\max(2-\\mu_j,0)=8-\\min(4-\\mu_1,\\mu_3)$: **8, 8, 8, 7, 7, 6** for $[4,2,0],[4,1,1],[3,3,0],[3,2,1]_\\pm,[2,2,2]$.\n- **Factors.** No $\\phi_{ij}$, $\\omega_{ij}$ or $\\omega_3$ factor appears. Explicitly: $[4,2,0]$: $(\\omega_1-\\phi_2)^2(\\omega_1-\\phi_3)^4(\\omega_2-\\phi_3)^2$; $[4,1,1]$: $(\\omega_1-\\phi_2)^3(\\omega_1-\\phi_3)^3(\\omega_2-\\phi_2)(\\omega_2-\\phi_3)$; $[3,3,0]$: $(\\omega_1-\\phi_1)(\\omega_1-\\phi_2)(\\omega_1-\\phi_3)^4(\\omega_2-\\phi_3)^2$; $[3,2,1]$: $(\\omega_1-\\phi_1)(\\omega_1-\\phi_2)^2(\\omega_1-\\phi_3)^3(\\omega_2-\\phi_3)$; $[2,2,2]$: $(\\omega_1-\\phi_1)^2(\\omega_1-\\phi_2)^2(\\omega_1-\\phi_3)^2$.\n- **Constants** $X_B$ (independent of $\\phi,\\omega$; functions of $t$ only): $X=1$ for $[4,2,0],[4,1,1],[3,3,0]$; $X_\\pm=(2\\pm\\sqrt{4+5t^2})/t^2$ for the two $[3,2,1]$ copies (roots of $X^2-4X/t^2-5/t^2$, the same $\\sqrt{4+5t^2}$ as the untwisted octet spectrum); $X=-8/(t^2-1)$ for the singlet.\n- **Evidence.** The monomial was fitted on 26 random $(\\phi,\\omega)$, with log-residuals $\\lesssim10^{-13}$ for all six states. The $X_B$ forms were read off at $h=1/2,\\theta=(2/7,-3/5)$ and checked at $h=1/3,\\theta=(1/5,-4/9)$ on 3 further $(\\phi,\\omega)$ each, to $\\sim10^{-13}$ (= $O(\\varepsilon)$ at $\\varepsilon=10^{-14}$). $\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle^2=(3h^4)^2$ was assumed at the second point.\n- **Dependence on $\\Psi$.** The whole $(\\phi,\\omega)$ dependence is a monomial fixed by the weight. The remaining state dependence $X_B$ is twist-independent, i.e. untwisted data, and it distinguishes the two $[3,2,1]$ copies. At finite $\\varepsilon$, $\\Omega$ and $x_0$ restricted to the 1- and 2-dimensional weight sectors are exactly parallel, so there $\\rho$ is the same for every state of that weight. In the $(3,2,1)$ and $(2,2,2)$ sectors they are not.\n- **Open.** Write $X_B$ as an untwisted-$Q$ expression (the untwisted limit of $\\det N[B,\\mathrm{vac}]/(c_0\\Phi_Q\\Psi_Q)$). Test the $n_{ij}$ rule on $[3,1,0]^{\\otimes2}$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 11b. The y₀-free ratio $R_B=\\rho_B/\\rho_{[4,2,0]}=(z_2-z_1)^2\\,\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi_B\\rangle/\\langle x_0|\\Psi_B\\rangle$\nFor $\\Psi=e_1\\otimes e_1$ (the 1-dimensional sector $(4,2,0)$) one has $\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi\\rangle=1$ and $\\langle x_0|\\Psi\\rangle=(z_2-z_1)^2$ exactly, so $\\rho_{[4,2,0]}=1/(\\langle\\Omega|y_0\\rangle(z_2-z_1)^2)$. The $\\varepsilon^8$ of Section 11 is therefore pure reference-vector normalization: $x_0,y_0$ are companion-frame vectors carried by the singular $P_{\\rm phys}$. The ratio $R_B$ drops $y_0$ and $c_0\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle^2\\Phi_Q^{\\rm vac}$. Prediction from Section 11: $R_B\\to\\varepsilon^{\\#_B-8}X_B\\prod(\\omega_i-\\phi_j)^{n_{ij}(B)-n_{ij}([4,2,0])}$, checked below directly from the vectors at both chain points.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* R_B from vectors only; also the exact statements <x0|e1⊗e1> = (z2-z1)^2, <Ω|e1⊗e1> = 1. The octet copies are ordered by Re ev, which matches (X-, X+); do not re-sort R_B by value (the monomial can flip the order) *)\nRlead[φv_, ωv_, eps_] := With[{zE = N[Exp[eps φv], 200], sts = Select[smallTw[eps, φv, ωv, 200][\"states\"], #[\"hwRes\"] < 10^-8 &]}, With[{o = Join[sts[[1 ;; 3]], SortBy[sts[[4 ;; 5]], Re[#[\"ev\"]] &], sts[[6 ;;]]]}, Table[(zE[[2]] - zE[[1]])^2 o[[b]][\"Ωψ/x0ψ\"]/eps^(sharpL[[b]] - 8), {b, 6}]]];\nRpred[φv_, ωv_, h_, th_] := Xpred[h, th] Table[Times @@ ((facs[φv, ωv])^(nExp[[b]] - nExp[[1]])), {b, 6}];\nexactE1 = With[{cv = covs[1/3, φT, ωT, 60], zz = N[Exp[φT/3], 60]}, Max[Abs[{cv[[2, 1]] - (zz[[2]] - zz[[1]])^2, cv[[1, 1]] - 1}]]];\ndevR[h_, th_, pts_] := Max[Table[Abs[Rlead[p[[1]], p[[2]], 10^-14]/Rpred[p[[1]], p[[2]], h, th] - 1], {p, pts}]];\ndevR1 = devR[hN, thN, fitPts[[7 ;; 9]]];\n{hSave, thSave} = {hN, thN}; hN = 1/3; thN = {1/5, -4/9}; clearTm[];\ndevR2 = devR[hN, thN, fitPts[[10 ;; 12]]];\nhN = hSave; thN = thSave; clearTm[];\nchecks[\"<x0|e1e1> = (z2-z1)^2, <Ω|e1e1> = 1 (finite ε)\"] = exactE1;\nGrid[{{\"check\", \"value\"}, {\"<x0|e1⊗e1> = (z2-z1)^2 and <Ω|e1⊗e1> = 1 at ε=1/3\", ScientificForm[N[exactE1, 3], 3]}, {\"R_B leading term vs prediction, h=1/2 (3 random φ,ω; max rel. dev)\", ScientificForm[N[devR1, 3], 3]}, {\"same at h=1/3, θ=(1/5,-4/9)\", ScientificForm[N[devR2, 3], 3]}, {\"restored\", {hN, thN}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"240\" data-out-n=\"2276\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"56\" data-sub-start=\"10\" data-sub-end=\"10\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[2276]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.05em;vertical-align:-2.755em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.295em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.01em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.755em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.255em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.415em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">check</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.215em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;x0|e1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">e1&gt; = (z2-z1)</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">2 and &lt;Ω|e1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">e1&gt; = 1 at </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mord\">=1/3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.015em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R_B leading term vs prediction, h=1/2 (3 random </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"mord\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">ω</span><span class=\"mord\">; max rel. dev)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.815em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">same at h=1/3, </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">=(1/5,-4/9)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.605em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">restored</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.755em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.01em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.755em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.255em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.415em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">value</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.215em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">-56</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.015em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">6.33</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">-14</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.815em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">3.76</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">-14</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.605em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.755em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.01em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.755em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.71em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.31em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.51em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.755em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[2276]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{check} & \\text{value}\\\\\\hline\\text{<x0|e1$\\otimes$e1> = (z2-z1)\\^{}2 and <$\\Omega$|e1$\\otimes$e1> = 1 at $\\varepsilon$=1/3} & \\text{0.}\\times 10^{\\text{-56}}\\\\\\hline\\text{R\\_B leading term vs prediction, h=1/2 (3 random $\\varphi$,$\\omega$; max rel. dev)} & \\text{6.33}\\times 10^{\\text{-14}}\\\\\\hline\\text{same at h=1/3, $\\theta$=(1/5,-4/9)} & \\text{3.76}\\times 10^{\\text{-14}}\\\\\\hline\\text{restored} & \\left\\{\\frac{1}{2},\\left\\{\\frac{2}{7},-\\frac{3}{5}\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
