   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result (11b).** $R_B=\\rho_B/\\rho_{[4,2,0]}=(z_2-z_1)^2\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi_B\\rangle/\\langle x_0|\\Psi_B\\rangle$ contains no $y_0$, $c_0$ or $\\Phi_Q^{\\rm vac}$. Its small-twist limit is\n$$R_B\\simeq X_B\\prod_{i,j}(w_i-z_j)^{\\Delta n_{ij}},\\qquad \\Delta n_{ij}=\\max(d_j-D_i,0)-\\max(d^{[4,2,0]}_j-D_i,0),$$\nwith $d=2\\lambda_1-\\mu$, $D=(0,2,4)$ and $t=\\theta_{12}/h$:\n\n| $B$ | $R_B$ (leading) | order |\n|---|---|---|\n| $[4,2,0]$ | $1$ | $\\varepsilon^0$ |\n| $[4,1,1]$ | $\\dfrac{(w_1-z_2)(w_2-z_2)}{(w_1-z_3)(w_2-z_3)}$ (**exact** at any twist) | $\\varepsilon^0$ |\n| $[3,3,0]$ | $\\dfrac{w_1-z_1}{w_1-z_2}=r_1$ (**exact** at any twist) | $\\varepsilon^0$ |\n| $[3,2,1]_\\pm$ | $\\dfrac{2\\pm\\sqrt{4+5t^2}}{t^2}\\,\\dfrac{w_1-z_1}{(w_1-z_3)(w_2-z_3)}$ | $\\varepsilon^{-1}$ |\n| $[2,2,2]$ | $-\\dfrac{8}{t^2-1}\\,\\dfrac{(w_1-z_1)^2}{(w_1-z_3)^2(w_2-z_3)^2}$ | $\\varepsilon^{-2}$ |\n\nHere $w_i-z_j\\simeq\\varepsilon(\\omega_i-\\phi_j)$. The table was checked directly from the vectors at $(h,\\theta)=(1/2,(2/7,-3/5))$ and $(1/3,(1/5,-4/9))$, 3 random $(\\phi,\\omega)$ each, to $\\sim10^{-13}$. In the 1- and 2-dimensional sectors $R$ does not depend on $\\theta$, $h$ or the state, and the two formulas hold exactly at $\\varepsilon=1/3$. The negative powers for the octets and the singlet are genuine: in those sectors $\\langle x_0|\\Psi_B\\rangle$ vanishes faster than $\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi_B\\rangle$ as $\\Psi_B\\to$ HW.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 11c. The CG chain at small twist: which $\\varepsilon$-powers come from where\nThe chain (Sections 10–10e) is\n$$c_\\lambda\\cdot(R\\otimes R)\\,\\Psi_B=\\frac{T^B_\\lambda(\\theta_1-2h)}{f_\\lambda}\\,\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi_B\\rangle=\\frac{T^B_\\lambda(\\theta_1-2h)}{f_\\lambda}\\,\\frac{\\langle\\Omega|y_0\\rangle}{\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle^2}\\,F^Q_B\\,\\langle x_0|\\Psi_B\\rangle,\\qquad c_\\lambda=\\langle v_\\lambda|R^{-1}\\otimes e_1^T ,$$\nwith $F^Q_B=\\det N[B,\\mathrm{vac}]/(c_0\\Phi^{\\rm vac}_Q\\Psi^B_Q)=\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle^2\\rho_B$. Section 10e replaced $(R\\otimes R)\\Psi_B$ by its HW limit. For each HW-limit state (unit norm $\\hat\\Psi_B$) and $\\lambda\\in\\{(1,1),(2,1)\\}$ the cell reports:\n- the exact identity residual;\n- the order of $c_\\lambda\\cdot(R\\otimes R)\\hat\\Psi_B$ versus the order of $c_\\lambda\\cdot P_{\\rm HW}\\hat\\Psi_B$ (the 10e quantity);\n- the orders of the Q-side factors $T^B_\\lambda$, $\\langle\\Omega|\\hat\\Psi_B\\rangle$, $\\langle x_0|\\hat\\Psi_B\\rangle$ and $\\langle x_0|P_{\\rm HW}\\hat\\Psi_B\\rangle$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* one-site T at θ₁ with twist diag(z) on the right (numeric generators), and HW bases at 250 digits *)\nT1zE[v_, zE_] := Table[(KroneckerDelta[i, k] (v - thN[[1]]) IdentityMatrix[d1] + hN EeN[i, k]) zE[[k]], {i, 3}, {k, 3}];\nt1zE[a_, v_, zE_] := Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[T1zE[v - (k - 1) hN, zE][[σ[[k]], I[[k]]]], {k, a}], {σ, Permutations[I]}], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\nhwB[μ_] := hwB[μ] = Module[{sec = Flatten[Position[wtBasis, μ]], ns}, ns = NullSpace[Join[EtotS[1, 2][[All, sec]], EtotS[2, 3][[All, sec]]]]; Orthogonalize[N[Table[Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> n], {d2}]], {n, ns}], 250]]];\ncgData[eps_, φv_, ωv_, pr_] := Module[{zE, wE, tt, mix, rr, Rg, RgI, Om1, Om2, RR, Pph, rsE, x02e, uLl = thN[[1]] - 2 hN, t12 = thN[[1]] - thN[[2]], fl, v11, v21, cl, ev, out = {}},\n  zE = N[Exp[eps φv], pr]; wE = N[Exp[eps ωv], pr];\n  tt = Table[tPoly[DiagonalMatrix[zE], a], {a, 2}]; mix = (tt[[1]] + N[Pi, pr] tt[[2]]) /. u -> 3/7;\n  rr = rOmF[zE, wE];\n  Rg = nexpS[rr[[1]] EeN[1, 2]] . nexpS[rr[[2]] EeN[1, 3]] . nexpS[rr[[3]] EeN[2, 3]]; RgI = nexpS[-rr[[3]] EeN[2, 3]] . nexpS[-rr[[2]] EeN[1, 3]] . nexpS[-rr[[1]] EeN[1, 2]];\n  Om1 = UnitVector[d1, 1] . Rg; Om2 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Om1, Om1]]; RR = KroneckerProduct[Rg, Rg];\n  rsE = rsSol /. Thread[zs -> zE];\n  Pph = nexpS[(r[1] /. rsE) Ee[3, 2]] . nexpS[(r[2] /. rsE) Ee[3, 1]] . nexpS[(r[3] /. rsE) Ee[2, 1]] . DiagonalMatrix[Table[Product[(s[k] /. rsE)^J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}]] . nexpS[(1/zE[[1]]) Ee[1, 2]] . nexpS[-(1/(zE[[1]] zE[[2]])) Ee[1, 3]] . nexpS[((zE[[1]] + zE[[2]])/(zE[[1]] zE[[2]])) Ee[2, 3]];\n  x02e = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[#, #]] &[UnitVector[d1, 1] . Inverse[Pph]];\n  fl = {(t12 - hN) (t12 - 3 hN), (t12 - hN)^2 (t12 - 3 hN)};\n  v11 = Om1 . t1zE[2, uLl, zE]; v21 = v11 . t1zE[1, uLl + hN, zE] - Om1 . t1zE[3, uLl + hN, zE];\n  cl = {Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v11 . RgI, UnitVector[d1, 1]]], Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v21 . RgI, UnitVector[d1, 1]]]};\n  Do[With[{sec = Flatten[Position[wtBasis, Λw]], hb = hwB[Λw]}, With[{es = Eigensystem[mix[[sec, sec]]]}, Do[With[{ψ0 = Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> es[[2, k]]], {d2}]]}, If[(Norm[EtotS[1, 2] . ψ0] + Norm[EtotS[2, 3] . ψ0])/Norm[ψ0] < 10^-3,\n        With[{ψ = ψ0/Norm[ψ0], km = Ordering[Abs[ψ0], -1][[1]]}, Module[{ph, ψh, Phw, eva, T11, T21, t3v, Tl, L2, L3},\n          ph = With[{c = hb . ψ}, Conjugate[c[[1]]]/Abs[c[[1]]]]; ψh = ph ψ; Phw = Total[hb (hb . ψh)];\n          eva[a_, x_] := ((tt[[a]] /. u -> x) . ψh)[[km]]/ψh[[km]];\n          t3v[x_] := (Times @@ zE) nuP[1][x] nuP[2][x - hN] nuP[3][x - 2 hN];\n          T11 = eva[2, uLl]; T21 = eva[2, uLl] eva[1, uLl + hN] - t3v[uLl + hN]; Tl = {T11, T21};\n          L2 = Table[cl[[l]] . RR . ψh, {l, 2}]; L3 = Table[Tl[[l]] (Om2 . ψh)/fl[[l]], {l, 2}];\n          AppendTo[out, <|\"mu\" -> Λw, \"ev\" -> es[[1, k]], \"L2\" -> L2, \"L3\" -> L3, \"HWtarget\" -> Table[cl[[l]] . Phw, {l, 2}], \"T\" -> Tl, \"Ωψ\" -> Om2 . ψh, \"x0ψ\" -> x02e . ψh, \"x0Phw\" -> x02e . Phw|>]]]]], {k, Length[sec]}]]], {Λw, hwSecs}];\n  SortBy[out, {Position[hwSecs, #[\"mu\"]][[1, 1]], Re[#[\"ev\"]]} &]];\nepsC = {10^-6, 10^-9};\ncgD = Table[cgData[e, φT, ωT, 200], {e, epsC}];\nordC[f_] := Round[Log[Abs[f[cgD[[2]]]/f[cgD[[1]]]]]/Log[epsC[[2]]/epsC[[1]]], 1/100];\ncgTab = Table[With[{b = bb}, Join[{cgD[[1, b]][\"mu\"]}, Flatten[Table[{ScientificForm[N[Max[Abs[cgD[[2, b]][\"L2\"][[l]]/cgD[[2, b]][\"L3\"][[l]] - 1]], 2], 2], N[ordC[#[[b]][\"L2\"][[l]] &]], N[ordC[#[[b]][\"HWtarget\"][[l]] &]], N[ordC[#[[b]][\"T\"][[l]] &]]}, {l, 2}]], {N[ordC[#[[b]][\"Ωψ\"] &]], N[ordC[#[[b]][\"x0ψ\"] &]], N[ordC[#[[b]][\"x0Phw\"] &]]}]], {bb, Length[cgD[[1]]]}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"(1,1) id. resid\", \"(1,1) # c·RRΨ\", \"(1,1) # c·P_HWΨ\", \"(1,1) # T\", \"(2,1) id. resid\", \"(2,1) # c·RRΨ\", \"(2,1) # c·P_HWΨ\", \"(2,1) # T\", \"# <Ω|Ψ>\", \"# <x0|Ψ>\", \"# <x0|P_HWΨ>\"}}, cgTab], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
