      {
       "data": "Out[2294]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\mu  & \\text{$\\lambda$ (1=(1,1), 2=(2,1))} & \\text{\\# ||$\\Psi$|| (<x0|$\\Psi$>=1)} & \\text{\\{$\\nu$, \\# contribution, \\# ||c\\^{}($\\nu$)||, \\# ||[RR$\\Psi$]\\_$\\nu$||\\}}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} & 1 & -2.\\, & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} & -2.\\, & 0.\\, & -2.\\,\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} & 2 & -2.\\, & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} & -2.\\, & 0.\\, & -2.\\,\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,1,1\\right\\} & 1 & -3.\\, & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} & -2.\\, & 0.\\, & -2.\\,\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,1,1\\right\\} & 2 & -3.\\, & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} & -2.\\, & 0.\\, & -2.\\,\\\\\\left\\{4,1,1\\right\\} & -2.\\, & 1.\\, & -3.\\,\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,3,0\\right\\} & 1 & -3.\\, & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} & -2.\\, & 0.\\, & -2.\\,\\\\\\left\\{3,3,0\\right\\} & -2.\\, & 1.\\, & -3.\\,\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,3,0\\right\\} & 2 & -3.\\, & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} & -2.\\, & 0.\\, & -2.\\,\\\\\\left\\{3,3,0\\right\\} & -2.\\, & 1.\\, & -3.\\,\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\} & 1 & -4.\\, & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} & -3.\\, & 0.\\, & -3.\\,\\\\\\left\\{3,3,0\\right\\} & -2.\\, & 1.\\, & -3.\\,\\\\\\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\} & -3.\\, & 1.\\, & -… [latex truncated: 2526 chars total]",
