   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result (11e).** For every HW-limit state and both $\\lambda$, $\\|W_\\mu\\|=O(\\varepsilon^0)$. The overlap $W_\\mu\\cdot h_\\mu$ is $O(\\varepsilon^{1})$ (or $\\varepsilon^2$ for the singlet), and exactly 0 for (1,1) at $[4,1,1]$ and $[2,2,2]$. These are the 10e CG orders: indeed $W_\\mu\\cdot h_\\mu=c_\\lambda\\cdot(R\\otimes R)h_\\mu=c_\\lambda\\cdot h_\\mu$ exactly. So the leading direction $w_0$ of $W_\\mu$ is **orthogonal** to $h_\\mu$, and $W_\\mu\\cdot\\Psi_B$ (with $\\langle x_0|\\Psi_B\\rangle=1$) scales as $\\varepsilon^{-2,-2,-2,-3,-3,-4}$, one order above the naive $\\varepsilon^{0-k}$. Its leading coefficient mixes $w_1\\cdot h_\\mu$ (the CG part) with $w_0\\cdot\\Psi^{(1)}_B$, where $\\Psi^{(1)}_B$ is the $O(\\varepsilon)$ correction of the eigenstate. That second piece is the $\\kappa$ contamination.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 11f. Coincident twist parameters $\\omega_i=\\phi_j$\n$\\Omega_{zw}$ does not depend on $w_3$. The rotation parameters satisfy $r_1\\propto(w_1-z_1)$, $r_2\\propto(w_1-z_1)(w_2-z_1)$ and $r_3\\propto(w_1-z_2)(w_2-z_2)$, with denominators $(w_1-z_2)$, $(w_1-z_3)$, $(w_2-z_3)$. The allowed single coincidences are $\\omega_1=\\phi_1$ ($R=e^{r_3E_{23}}$), $\\omega_2=\\phi_1$ ($r_2=0$) and $\\omega_2=\\phi_2$ ($r_3=0$). For each, the cell gives the orders of the chain value $c\\cdot RR\\hat\\Psi$ and of the CG term $c\\cdot P_{HW}\\hat\\Psi$, together with their ratio $\\kappa$ at $\\varepsilon=10^{-9}$. The ratio is 1 when there is no contamination.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "coinCases = {\"ω₁=φ₁\" -> {φT[[1]], ωT[[2]], ωT[[3]]}, \"ω₂=φ₁\" -> {ωT[[1]], φT[[1]], ωT[[3]]}, \"ω₂=φ₂\" -> {ωT[[1]], φT[[2]], ωT[[3]]}};\ncoinTab = Flatten[Table[With[{dd = Table[cgData[e, φT, cc[[2]], 200], {e, epsC}]}, Table[With[{A = dd[[1, b]], B = dd[[2, b]]}, {cc[[1]], A[\"mu\"], Sequence @@ Flatten[Table[{ordP[A[\"L2\"][[l]], B[\"L2\"][[l]]], ordP[A[\"HWtarget\"][[l]], B[\"HWtarget\"][[l]]], If[Abs[B[\"HWtarget\"][[l]]] < 10^-150, \"CG=0\", N[B[\"L2\"][[l]]/B[\"HWtarget\"][[l]], 6]]}, {l, 2}]]}], {b, Length[dd[[1]]]}]], {cc, coinCases}], 1];\nGrid[Join[{{\"case\", \"μ\", \"(1,1) # chain\", \"(1,1) # CG\", \"(1,1) κ\", \"(2,1) # chain\", \"(2,1) # CG\", \"(2,1) κ\"}}, coinTab], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
