   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result (11f): coincidences do not help.** In every case either the chain value and the CG term both vanish exactly, or $\\kappa$ is unchanged ($(t+1)/2=97/70$ for $[3,3,0]$ and $[4,1,1]$(2,1), $1.5294/1.0723$ for the octet, $1.10197$ for the singlet (2,1)).\n- **$\\omega_1=\\phi_1$:** $[3,3,0]$, $[3,2,1]$ and $[2,2,2]$ vanish exactly on both sides; $[4,1,1]$ keeps $\\kappa$.\n- **$\\omega_2=\\phi_2$:** $[4,1,1]$ vanishes on both sides; the rest keep $\\kappa$.\n- **$\\omega_2=\\phi_1$:** nothing new vanishes; $\\kappa$ is unchanged.\n\nThis is consistent with $\\kappa$ being independent of $\\phi$ and $\\omega$: the contamination has the same twist dependence as the CG term, so no choice of $\\omega$ separates them.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 11g. Removing the contamination: kill the $[4,2,0]$ component of the covector\nFrom 10d, $c_{(2,1)}\\cdot h_{[4,2,0]}=-hz_3\\,c_{(1,1)}\\cdot h_{[4,2,0]}$ exactly, and $h_{[4,2,0]}=e_1\\otimes e_1$ spans its 1-dimensional weight space. So $C=c_{(2,1)}+hz_3\\,c_{(1,1)}$ has **no** $[4,2,0]$ component, which was the source of the leading contamination (11d). On the Q side this is $\\big(T^B_{(2,1)}/f_{(2,1)}+hz_3T^B_{(1,1)}/f_{(1,1)}\\big)\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi_B\\rangle$. The cell reports $\\kappa_C=C\\cdot(R\\otimes R)\\hat\\Psi\\big/C\\cdot P_{HW}\\hat\\Psi$ at $\\varepsilon=10^{-9}$ for three twist directions and both chain points.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "kapC[d_, e_, φv_] := With[{z3 = N[Exp[e φv[[3]]], 200]}, Table[With[{x = d[[b]]}, With[{num = x[\"L2\"][[2]] + hN z3 x[\"L2\"][[1]], den = x[\"HWtarget\"][[2]] + hN z3 x[\"HWtarget\"][[1]]}, If[Abs[den] < 10^-150, If[Abs[num] < 10^-150, \"both 0\", \"CG=0, chain≠0\"], num/den]]], {b, Length[d]}]];\nkC = {kapC[cgD[[2]], 10^-9, φT], kapC[cgData[10^-9, φT, {3/4, -1/3, 2/9}, 200], 10^-9, φT], kapC[cgData[10^-9, {1/2, 1/5, -4/7}, {-5/6, 3/8, 1/9}, 200], 10^-9, {1/2, 1/5, -4/7}]};\n{hSave, thSave} = {hN, thN}; hN = 1/3; thN = {1/5, -4/9}; clearTm[];\nkC2 = kapC[cgData[10^-9, φT, ωT, 200], 10^-9, φT];\nhN = hSave; thN = thSave; clearTm[];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"κ_C (φT,ωT)\", \"κ_C (φT,ω')\", \"κ_C (φ',ω'')\", \"κ_C at h=1/3, θ=(1/5,-4/9)\"}}, Table[{cgD[[2, b]][\"mu\"], Sequence @@ (If[StringQ[#], #, N[#, 8]] & /@ {kC[[1, b]], kC[[2, b]], kC[[3, b]], kC2[[b]]})}, {b, Length[cgD[[2]]]}]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
