  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* products of two t's at θ2 + ℤh (numeric, 60 digits): which ⟨Ω|t_a(x) t_b(y) are site-2 local but not ∝ Ω? *)\nClearAll[tAtN];\ntAtN[a_, x_] := tAtN[a, x] = N[RootReduce[tZ[[a]] /. u -> x], 60];\nΩ2N = N[RootReduce[Ω2], 60]; Ω1N = N[RootReduce[Ω1], 60];\nsite2N[c_] := Module[{m = Transpose[Partition[c, d1]]}, Max[Abs[m - Outer[Times, m . Ω1N/(Ω1N . Ω1N), Ω1N]]]/Max[Abs[c], 10^-50]];\neigN[c_] := Max[Abs[c - (c . Ω2N/(Ω2N . Ω2N)) Ω2N]]/Max[Abs[c], 10^-50];\nprodScan = Select[Flatten[Table[With[{c = (Ω2N . tAtN[a, thN[[2]] + x hN]) . tAtN[b, thN[[2]] + y hN]}, {a, x, b, y, site2N[c] < 10^-40, eigN[c] < 10^-40, Max[Abs[c]] < 10^-40}], {a, 1, 2}, {x, -4, 4}, {b, a, 2}, {y, -4, 4}], 3], #[[5]] && ! #[[6]] && ! #[[7]] &];\nchecks[\"products t_a(θ2+xh) t_b(θ2+yh): only t1(θ2-h) t2(θ2+h) is site-2 local\"] = prodScan[[All, 1 ;; 4]] === {{1, -1, 2, 1}};\n(* exact factorization against the one-site chain at θ2 (same twist) *)\nT2z[v_] := Table[(KroneckerDelta[i, k] (v - thN[[2]]) IdentityMatrix[d1] + hN Ee[i, k]) zN[[k]], {i, 3}, {k, 3}];\nt2site[a_, v_] := Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[T2z[v - (k - 1) hN][[σ[[k]], I[[k]]]], {k, a}], {σ, Permutations[I]}], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\ncA = Ω2 . (tZ[[2]] /. u -> thN[[2]] + hN); cB = cA . (tZ[[1]] /. u -> thN[[2]] - hN);\nwA = Ω1 . t2site[2, thN[[2]] + hN]; wB = wA . t2site[1, thN[[2]] - hN];\nθ12 = thN[[1]] - thN[[2]]; χ3z = Times @@ zN;\n(* Corrected and symbolically proved in Section 13d; the old beta agreed only at h=1/2. *)\nfA = (θ12 - hN) (θ12 - 3 hN); αB = -(θ12 - hN)^2 (θ12 - 3 hN); βB = 6 hN^4 χ3z (θ12 - hN) (θ12 - 3 hN);\nchecks[\"<Ω|t2(θ2+h) = (θ12-h)(θ12-3h) <Ωzw| ⊗ <Ωzw|t2^{L=1,θ2}(θ2+h)\"] = zeroQ[cA - fA Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Ω1, wA]]];\nchecks[\"<Ω|t2(θ2+h)t1(θ2-h) = <Ωzw| ⊗ (α <Ωzw|t2^{L=1}(θ2+h)t1^{L=1}(θ2-h) + β <Ωzw|)\"] = zeroQ[cB - Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Ω1, αB wB + βB Ω1]]];\nchecks[\"site-2 vectors nontrivial: rank{Ωzw, v_A, v_B} = 3\"] = MatrixRank[N[RootReduce[{Ω1, wA, wB}], 60]] == 3;\nGrid[{{\"site-2 local products {a,x,b,y}\", prodScan[[All, 1 ;; 4]]},\n  {\"<Ω|t2(θ2+h) factorizes, f = (θ12-h)(θ12-3h)\", checks[\"<Ω|t2(θ2+h) = (θ12-h)(θ12-3h) <Ωzw| ⊗ <Ωzw|t2^{L=1,θ2}(θ2+h)\"]},\n  {\"<Ω|t2(θ2+h)t1(θ2-h) factorizes, α = -(θ12-h)^2(θ12-3h), β = 6h^4 χ3 (θ12-h)(θ12-3h)\", checks[\"<Ω|t2(θ2+h)t1(θ2-h) = <Ωzw| ⊗ (α <Ωzw|t2^{L=1}(θ2+h)t1^{L=1}(θ2-h) + β <Ωzw|)\"]},\n  {\"nontrivial (rank 3)\", checks[\"site-2 vectors nontrivial: rank{Ωzw, v_A, v_B} = 3\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
