   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 12c. Does site 2 fix the octet mixing and the singlet scale? (redo of 11h)\nData, all allowed by the overlap formula, for many vacuum twists $w$ (twist $z=e^{\\varepsilon\\varphi}$ fixed):\n- **site1:** $\\langle\\Omega|T_{(1,1)}(\\theta_1-2h)$, $\\langle\\Omega|T_{(2,1)}(\\theta_1-2h)$ (the 11h family, via `wCov`);\n- **site2:** $\\langle\\Omega|t_2(\\theta_2+h)$, $\\langle\\Omega|t_2(\\theta_2+h)t_1(\\theta_2-h)$, built from the exact two-site $t$'s at each $\\varepsilon$ so that the one-point coefficient fits of Result 12 are not used;\n- **Ω:** the bare $\\langle\\Omega(w)|$ (the overlap formula itself; 11h did not include it);\n- always the normalization row $\\langle x_0|$.\n\nThe cell also checks that the site-2 covectors are site-2 local at these new twists. Then it reports the rank per weight space for each family and reconstructs $\\Psi_B$ from site1 + site2 at $\\varepsilon=10^{-6},10^{-9}$, giving the error in $\\Psi_B$ and in its HW part, scale included.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "covFam[eps_, φv_, ωs_, pr_] := Module[{zE = N[Exp[eps φv], pr], tt, A2, B2},\n   tt = Table[tPoly[DiagonalMatrix[zE], a], {a, 2}];\n   A2 = tt[[2]] /. u -> thN[[2]] + hN; B2 = A2 . (tt[[1]] /. u -> thN[[2]] - hN);\n   Table[With[{rr = rOmF[zE, N[Exp[eps ωv], pr]]}, With[{Om1 = UnitVector[d1, 1] . nexpS[rr[[1]] EeN[1, 2]] . nexpS[rr[[2]] EeN[1, 3]] . nexpS[rr[[3]] EeN[2, 3]]}, With[{Om2 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Om1, Om1]]},\n        <|\"site1\" -> wCov[eps, φv, ωv, pr], \"Ω\" -> {Om2}, \"site2\" -> {Om2 . A2, Om2 . B2},\n         \"loc2\" -> Max[Table[With[{m = Transpose[Partition[c, d1]]}, Max[Abs[m - Outer[Times, m . Om1/(Om1 . Om1), Om1]]]/Max[Abs[c]]], {c, {Om2 . A2, Om2 . B2}}]]|>]]], {ωv, ωs}]];\nfamList = {{\"site1\"}, {\"site1\", \"Ω\"}, {\"site2\"}, {\"site2\", \"Ω\"}, {\"site1\", \"site2\"}, {\"site1\", \"site2\", \"Ω\"}};\nrankFam[eps_, φv_, ωs_, pr_] := Module[{cf = covFam[eps, φv, ωs, pr], x0 = x0Cov[eps, φv, pr]},\n   {Max[cf[[All, \"loc2\"]]], Table[With[{sec = Flatten[Position[wtBasis, μ]]}, Join[{μ, Length[sec]}, Table[rankTol[Append[Flatten[Table[Flatten[c /@ f, 1], {c, cf}], 1][[All, sec]], x0[[sec]]], 10^-40][[1]], {f, famList}]]], {μ, hwSecs}]}];\n(* data b = M.ψ stand in for the Q side, T^B(u)<Ω|Ψ_B> (exact identity); full rank => Ψ_B fixed, normalization from the x0 row *)\nreconF[eps_, φv_, ωs_, pr_, fam_] := Module[{sts = psiStates[eps, φv, pr], cf = covFam[eps, φv, ωs, pr], x0 = x0Cov[eps, φv, pr]},\n  Table[With[{μ = st[\"mu\"], sec = Flatten[Position[wtBasis, st[\"mu\"]]]}, Module[{M, ψt, ψr, hb},\n      M = Append[Flatten[Table[Flatten[c /@ fam, 1], {c, cf}], 1][[All, sec]], x0[[sec]]]; ψt = st[\"ψ\"][[sec]];\n      ψr = LeastSquares[M, M . ψt]; hb = hwB[μ][[All, sec]];\n      {μ, Length[sec], rankTol[M, 10^-80][[1]], N[Norm[ψr - ψt]/Norm[ψt], 3], N[Norm[hb . ψr - hb . ψt]/Norm[hb . ψt], 3]}]], {st, sts}]];\n{rkTime, {loc2Max, rk12}} = AbsoluteTiming[rankFam[1/3, φT, ωMany[[1 ;; 12]], 80]];\nrc12 = Table[{e, Sequence @@ #} & /@ reconF[e, φT, ωMany[[1 ;; 12]], 200, {\"site1\", \"site2\"}], {e, {10^-6, 10^-9}}];\nchecks[\"site-2 covectors stay site-2 local at ε=1/3, 12 w (max rel. resid)\"] = loc2Max;\nchecks[\"site1+site2: full rank in every HW weight space (ε=1/3)\"] = AllTrue[rk12, #[[7]] == #[[2]] &];\nchecks[\"site1+site2 reconstruction of all 6 HW-limit states (max rel. error, ε=1e-6,1e-9)\"] = Max[Flatten[Table[r[[{5, 6}]], {r, Flatten[rc12, 1]}]]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"site-2 locality at ε=1/3 (max rel. resid)\", ScientificForm[N[loc2Max, 3], 3], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}},\n   {Join[{\"μ\", \"dim\"}, StringRiffle[#, \"+\"] & /@ famList]}, rk12, {{\"time (s)\", rkTime}},\n   {{\"ε\", \"μ\", \"dim\", \"rank site1+site2 (+x0)\", \"rel. error Ψ\", \"rel. error HW part\"}}, Flatten[rc12, 1]], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"256\" data-out-n=\"2434\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"85\" data-sub-start=\"20\" data-sub-end=\"22\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[2434]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:25.3013em;vertical-align:-12.3806em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:12.9206em;\"><span style=\"top:-14.8806em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.8806em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:25.2613em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-12.3806em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:12.8806em;\"><span style=\"top:-15.0406em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">site-2 locality at </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mord\">=1/3 (max rel. resid)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-13.8406em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.6406em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" sty