  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 13. Independent audit and Q-driven reconstruction (2026-10-01)\n\nThis section needs only cells 3–14. It does not use the earlier reconstruction's right-hand side $M\\Psi$. First audit the one-point localization fits, then reconstruct from Baxter polynomials and determinant overlaps. Reference eigenvectors are used only to supply the spectral input and to check the answer.\n\n### 13a. Dimensionless symbolic localization audit\n\nSet $h=1,\\theta_2=0,\\theta_1=d$; homogeneity restores arbitrary $h,\\theta$. Keep the original rational twists for this first symbolic test. Matrix-shaped covectors avoid forming symbolic $64\\times64$ products.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[auditL, auditTRow, auditTrow, auditOne, auditOneT];\nauditL[i_,j_,x_,hh_] := KroneckerDelta[i,j] x IdentityMatrix[d1] + hh Ee[i,j];\nauditTRow[m_,i_,j_,x_,hh_,ths_,zz_] := Expand[zz[[j]] Sum[Transpose[auditL[i,k,x-ths[[1]],hh]] . m . auditL[k,j,x-ths[[2]],hh],{k,3}]];\nauditTrow[m_,a_,x_,hh_,ths_,zz_] := Expand[Sum[Signature[pp] Fold[auditTRow[#1,Sequence@@#2,hh,ths,zz]&,m,Table[{pp[[k]],ii[[k]],x-(k-1) hh},{k,a}]],{ii,Subsets[Range[3],{a}]},{pp,Permutations[ii]}]];\nauditOne[i_,j_,x_,hh_,zz_] := auditL[i,j,x,hh] zz[[j]];\nauditOneT[a_,x_,hh_,zz_] := Expand[Sum[Signature[pp] Dot@@Table[auditOne[pp[[k]],ii[[k]],x-(k-1) hh,hh,zz],{k,a}],{ii,Subsets[Range[3],{a}]},{pp,Permutations[ii]}]];\nauditM = Outer[Times,Ω1,Ω1];\nauditA = auditTrow[auditM,2,1,1,{dd,0},zN];\nauditB = auditTrow[auditA,1,-1,1,{dd,0},zN];\nauditWA = Expand[Ω1 . auditOneT[2,1,1,zN]];\nauditWB = Expand[auditWA . auditOneT[1,-1,1,zN]];\nauditAB = First[Solve[Thread[Flatten[auditB-Outer[Times,Ω1,aa auditWB+bb Ω1]]==0],{aa,bb}]];\nauditSymbolic = {zeroQ[auditA-(dd-1)(dd-3)Outer[Times,Ω1,auditWA]], Factor[{aa,bb}/.auditAB]};\nGrid[{{\"twists\", {zN,wN}},{\"site-2 A, symbolic d\",auditSymbolic[[1]]},{\"site-2 B coefficients {alpha,beta}, h=1\",auditSymbolic[[2]]},{\"old beta at h=1\",3(Times@@zN)(dd-1)(dd-3)}},Frame->All,Alignment->Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
