  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Correction found.** The symbolic result is $\\beta=6h^4\\chi_3(\\theta_{12}-h)(\\theta_{12}-3h)$, not $3h^3\\chi_3(\\theta_{12}-h)(\\theta_{12}-3h)$. They coincide at the old test point $h=1/2$. The coefficient has spectral degree six, as required for $t_2t_1$. The next cell validates all four localizing rows at independent rational points and compares the row-action implementation with the original matrices.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "auditR[zz_,ww_] := Module[{rr},rr={(ww[[1]]-zz[[1]])/(ww[[1]]-zz[[2]]),((ww[[1]]-zz[[1]])(-ww[[2]]+zz[[1]])(zz[[2]]-zz[[3]]))/((zz[[1]]-zz[[2]])(ww[[1]]-zz[[3]])(ww[[2]]-zz[[3]])),((ww[[1]]-zz[[2]])(-ww[[2]]+zz[[2]])(zz[[1]]-zz[[3]]))/((zz[[1]]-zz[[2]])(ww[[1]]-zz[[3]])(-ww[[2]]+zz[[3]]))}; MatrixExp[rr[[1]] Ee[1,2]] . MatrixExp[rr[[2]] Ee[1,3]] . MatrixExp[rr[[3]] Ee[2,3]]];\nauditLocal[hh_,ths_,zz_,ww_] := Module[{om,m,dt,f,a,b,s11,s21,sA,sB,ww11,ww21,wwA,wwB,actual,pred},\nom=UnitVector[d1,1] . auditR[zz,ww]; m=Outer[Times,om,om];dt=ths[[1]]-ths[[2]]; f=(dt-hh)(dt-3 hh);\ns11=auditTrow[m,2,ths[[1]]-2 hh,hh,ths,zz];\ns21=auditTrow[s11,1,ths[[1]]-hh,hh,ths,zz]-(Times@@zz)Product[ths[[1]]-hh-ths[[s]]+2 hh,{s,2}]Product[ths[[1]]-hh-ths[[s]],{s,2}]Product[ths[[1]]-3 hh-ths[[s]],{s,2}] m;\nsA=auditTrow[m,2,ths[[2]]+hh,hh,ths,zz];sB=auditTrow[sA,1,ths[[2]]-hh,hh,ths,zz];\nww11=om . auditOneT[2,-2 hh,hh,zz];ww21=ww11 . auditOneT[1,-hh,hh,zz]-om . auditOneT[3,-hh,hh,zz];\nwwA=om . auditOneT[2,hh,hh,zz];wwB=wwA . auditOneT[1,-hh,hh,zz];\nactual={s11,s21,sA,sB}; pred={f Outer[Times,ww11,om],(dt-hh)f Outer[Times,ww21,om],f Outer[Times,om,wwA],Outer[Times,om,-(dt-hh)f wwB+6 hh^4(Times@@zz)f om]};\n{And@@MapThread[zeroQ[#1-#2]&,{actual,pred}],zeroQ[sB-Outer[Times,om,-(dt-hh)f wwB+3 hh^3(Times@@zz)f om]]}];\nauditPoints={{hN,thN,zN,wN},{1/3,{1/5,-4/9},{7/5,9/7,4/5},{11/5,5/3,3/7}},{2/5,{-2/3,3/8},{5/3,8/7,3/4},{9/4,7/4,2/5}}};\nauditLocalResults=auditLocal@@@auditPoints;\nauditRowCross=And@@Table[zeroQ[Flatten[auditTrow[auditM,a,2/11,hN,thN,zN]]-Ω2 . (tZ[[a]]/.u->2/11)],{a,2}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"point\",\"all four corrected identities (exact)\",\"old beta holds?\"}},MapThread[{#1[[1;;2]],Sequence@@#2}&,{auditPoints,auditLocalResults}],{{\"row action vs original t1,t2\",auditRowCross}}],Frame->All,Alignment->Left]",
