   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 13b. Normalize the determinant by the top state\n\nWrite $D_B(w)=\\det N[B,\\mathrm{vac}_w]$, $P_B=\\Psi_Q^B(x_0)$, and $B_0=e_1\\otimes e_1$. The state-independent prefactor cancels:\n$$\n\\frac{\\langle\\Omega(w)|\\Psi_B\\rangle}{\\langle x_0|\\Psi_B\\rangle}\n=\\frac{D_B(w)P_{B_0}}{D_{B_0}(w)P_B(z_2-z_1)^2}.\n$$\nThis uses $\\langle\\Omega|B_0\\rangle=1$ and $\\langle x_0|B_0\\rangle=(z_2-z_1)^2$. Per-ladder and exponential-insertion brackets give the same ratio. No $y_0,c_0,\\Phi_Q$ construction is needed.\n\nThe helpers below take spectral/Q input only. The transfer eigenvalues are recovered from the dual Baxter equations, so the reconstruction's right-hand side can be made entirely from Q-polynomials.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Independent helpers: fixed degrees, no Chop, no eigenvector access in auditQOverlap or auditFromQ. *)\nauditNu[hh_,ths_,n_,x_] := Product[x-ths[[s]]+hh Λ[[n]],{s,Length[ths]}];\nauditVac[zz_,hh_,ths_] := Table[Sum[Times@@Table[zz[[ii[[k]]]] auditNu[hh,ths,ii[[k]],u-(k-1)hh],{k,a}],{ii,Subsets[Range[3],{a}]}],{a,3}];\nauditQdet[zz_,hh_,ths_,x_] := (Times@@zz) auditNu[hh,ths,1,x] auditNu[hh,ths,2,x-hh] auditNu[hh,ths,3,x-2 hh];\nauditOp[tt_,q_,zz_,sgn_,hh_,ths_,x_] := If[sgn==1,\nauditNu[hh,ths,3,x] auditNu[hh,ths,3,x-hh] auditNu[hh,ths,3,x-2 hh] zz (q/.X->x+hh)\n-(tt[[1]]/.u->x) auditNu[hh,ths,3,x-hh] auditNu[hh,ths,3,x-2 hh](q/.X->x)\n+(tt[[2]]/.u->x) auditNu[hh,ths,3,x-2 hh](q/.X->x-hh)/zz\n-(tt[[3]]/.u->x)(q/.X->x-2 hh)/zz^2,\nauditNu[hh,ths,1,x] auditNu[hh,ths,1,x+hh] auditNu[hh,ths,1,x+2 hh] zz(q/.X->x-hh)\n-(tt[[1]]/.u->x) auditNu[hh,ths,1,x+hh] auditNu[hh,ths,1,x+2 hh](q/.X->x)\n+(tt[[2]]/.u->x+hh) auditNu[hh,ths,1,x+2 hh](q/.X->x+hh)/zz\n-(tt[[3]]/.u->x+2 hh)(q/.X->x+2 hh)/zz^2];\nauditMonicQ[tt_,zz_,sgn_,deg_,hh_,ths_,pr_] := Module[{vars,eq,ar,sol},\nIf[deg==0,Return[1]];vars=Array[aq,deg]; eq=CoefficientList[Expand[auditOp[tt,X^deg+Sum[vars[[k+1]]X^k,{k,0,deg-1}],zz,sgn,hh,ths,X]],X];\nar=CoefficientArrays[eq,vars];sol=LeastSquares[N[Normal[ar[[2]]],pr],-N[Normal[ar[[1]]],pr]];\nExpand[X^deg+Sum[sol[[k+1]]X^k,{k,0,deg-1}]]];\nauditFromQ[qq_,zz_,hh_,ths_,pr_] := Module[{vars,tt,eq,ar,sol},vars=Array[at,8];tt={Sum[vars[[k+1]]u^k,{k,0,2}],Sum[vars[[k+4]]u^k,{k,0,4}],auditQdet[zz,hh,ths,u]};\neq=Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Expand[auditOp[tt,qq[[j]],zz[[j]],1,hh,ths,X]],X],{j,3}]];\nar=CoefficientArrays[eq,vars];sol=LeastSquares[N[Normal[ar[[2]]],pr],-N[Normal[ar[[1]]],pr]];tt/.Thread[vars->sol]];\nauditDet[qq_,qdv_,zz_,ww_,hh_,ths_,pr_] := Module[{pp,pair,up,dn,xp,wt,row},\npp=Flatten[Table[{s,n},{s,2},{n,0,2}],1];pair={{1,3},{1,2},{2,3}};\nxp[p_]:=ths[[p[[1]]]]-hh p[[2]];wt[p_]:=1/Product[xp[p]-xp[q],{q,DeleteCases[pp,p]}];\nup[j_,x_]:=zz[[j]]^(x/hh)(qq[[j]]/.X->x);dn[i_,x_]:=ww[[i]]^(-x/hh)(qdv[[i]]/.X->x);\nrow[{i_,j_},s_]:=Sum[With[{x=xp[p]},N[wt[p],pr]{-up[j,x]dn[i,x],-x up[j,x]dn[i,x],up[j,x]dn[i,x+hh],x up[j,x]dn[i,x+hh],up[j,x-hh]dn[i,x],x up[j,x-hh]dn[i,x]}],{p,Select[pp,First[#]==s&]}];\nDet[Flatten[Table[row[ij,s],{s,2},{ij,pair}],1]]];\nauditPsiQ[qq_,zz_,hh_,ths_] := Module[{up},up[j_,x_]:=zz[[j]]^(x/hh)(qq[[j]]/.X->x);\nProduct[With[{x=ths[[s]]},(up[2,x-2 hh]up[3,x-3 hh]-up[3,x-2 hh]up[2,x-3 hh])up[3,x-hh]],{s,2}]];\nauditQOverlap[qq_,qqtop_,qdv_,zz_,ww_,hh_,ths_,pr_] := auditDet[qq,qdv,zz,ww,hh,ths,pr]auditPsiQ[qqtop,zz,hh,ths]/(auditDet[qqtop,qdv,zz,ww,hh,ths,pr]auditPsiQ[qq,zz,hh,ths](zz[[2]]-zz[[1]])^2);\nauditTop=First@First@Position[muS,{4,2,0}];\nauditVacCheck=zeroQ[auditVac[wN,hN,thN]-tauVac];\nauditQFixed=Table[auditQOverlap[qu[[b]],qu[[auditTop]],qdVac,N[zN,prec],N[wN,prec],hN,thN,prec],{b,nS}];\nGrid[{{\"vacuum transfer formula exact\",auditVacCheck},{\"Q-ratio overlaps computed\",Length[auditQFixed]},{\"top-state reference\",auditTop}},Frame->All,Alignment->Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
