  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 13c. The full Q-to-CG chain at small twist\n\nUse three fixed, reproducible bra directions. The monic Baxter solver uses the known degree and overdetermined coefficient equations, with no precision-cutting Chop. Transfer eigenvalues in the reconstruction are recovered from dual Q's. Exact local covectors use only 8-dimensional one-site matrices and the independently checked factors. The 64-dimensional eigensystem supplies test spectral data and reference vectors; it is not the reconstruction right-hand side.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[auditBasisPoly];\n(* Exact transfer coefficient templates; only twists are numerical in the small-epsilon run. *)\nauditMono[x_,hh_,ths_] := auditMono[x,hh,ths] = Table[Sum[KroneckerProduct[auditL[i,k,x-ths[[1]],hh],auditL[k,j,x-ths[[2]],hh]],{k,3}],{i,3},{j,3}];\nauditMinor[ii_,a_,x_,hh_,ths_] := Sum[Signature[pp] Dot@@Table[auditMono[x-(k-1)hh,hh,ths][[pp[[k]],ii[[k]]]],{k,a}],{pp,Permutations[ii]}];\nauditBasisPoly[hh_,ths_,a_,ii_] := auditBasisPoly[hh,ths,a,ii] = Module[{nodes=Range[0,2 a]/3+1/7},\nExpand[Sum[auditMinor[ii,a,nodes[[k]],hh,ths] Product[(u-nodes[[l]])/(nodes[[k]]-nodes[[l]]),{l,DeleteCases[Range[Length[nodes]],k]}],{k,Length[nodes]}]]];\nauditTransfer[zz_,hh_,ths_,pr_] := Table[Sum[(Times@@zz[[ii]])N[auditBasisPoly[hh,ths,a,ii],pr],{ii,Subsets[Range[3],{a}]}],{a,2}];\nauditHWSectors={{4,2,0},{4,1,1},{3,3,0},{3,2,1},{2,2,2}};\nauditHW[mu_] := auditHW[mu] = Module[{sec=Flatten[Position[wtBasis,mu]],ns}, ns=NullSpace[Join[(E1[1,2]+E2[1,2])[[All,sec]],(E1[2,3]+E2[2,3])[[All,sec]]]];RootReduce[Orthogonalize[ns,Simplify[#1 . #2]&]]];\n(* Avoid Norm interpreting tracked approximate zeros as exact zeros in diagnostics. *)\nauditNorm[v_,pr_] := Norm[SetPrecision[v,pr]];\nauditSmall[hh_,ths_,eps_,pr_,ph_,oms_] := Module[{zz=N[Exp[eps ph],pr],wws=N[Exp[eps #],pr]&/@oms,tm,x0,mat,topq,vqs,sts={},out={},qres=0,tres=0,overres=0,sec,es,pick,rr,qq,tq,tt,psi,km,ov,refov,rhs,sc,m,reco,errAbs,errRel,hwerr,hb,hbr},\ntm=auditTransfer[zz,hh,ths,pr]; x0=auditX0[zz];\nmat=Append[Flatten[Table[auditRows[zz,ww,hh,ths],{ww,wws}],1],x0];\ntopq=Table[auditMonicQ[N[auditVac[zz,hh,ths],pr],zz[[j]],1,{4,2,0}[[j]],hh,ths,pr],{j,3}];\nvqs=Table[Table[auditMonicQ[N[auditVac[ww,hh,ths],pr],ww[[j]],-1,2(j-1),hh,ths,pr],{j,3}],{ww,wws}];\nDo[sec=Flatten[Position[wtBasis,mu]];hb=N[auditHW[mu],pr];\nes=Eigensystem[((tm[[1]]+N[Pi,pr]tm[[2]])/.u->3/7)[[sec,sec]]];\nrr=Table[Norm[Join[(E1[1,2]+E2[1,2])[[All,sec]] . v,(E1[2,3]+E2[2,3])[[All,sec]] . v]]/Norm[v],{v,es[[2]]}];\npick=SortBy[Ordering[rr,Length[hb]],Re[es[[1,#]]]&];\nDo[psi=es[[2,k]]/(x0[[sec]] . es[[2,k]]);km=First@Ordering[Abs[psi],-1];\ntt=Append[Table[Expand[(tm[[a,sec,sec]] . psi)[[km]]/psi[[km]]],{a,2}],auditQdet[zz,hh,ths,u]];\nqq=Table[auditMonicQ[tt,zz[[j]],1,mu[[j]],hh,ths,pr],{j,3}];\ntq=auditFromQ[qq,zz,hh,ths,pr];\ntres=Max[tres,Max[Abs[SetPrecision[Flatten[CoefficientList[Expand[tq-tt],u]],pr]]]];\nqres=Max[qres,Max[Table[Norm[SetPrecision[CoefficientList[Expand[auditOp[tt,qq[[j]],zz[[j]],1,hh,ths,X]],X],pr]]/Max[1,Norm[CoefficientList[qq[[j]],X]]],{j,3}]]];\nov=MapThread[auditQOverlap[qq,topq,#1,zz,#2,hh,ths,pr]&,{vqs,wws}];\nrefov=Table[With[{om=UnitVector[d1,1] . auditR[zz,ww]},Flatten[Outer[Times,om,om]][[sec]] . psi],{ww,wws}];\noverres=Max[overres,Max[Abs[SetPrecision[ov/refov-1,pr]]]];\nrhs=Append[Flatten[Table[ov[[j]]auditEigenRows[tq,hh,ths],{j,Length[wws]}]],1];\nm=mat[[All,sec]];sc=Norm/@m;reco=LeastSquares[MapThread[#1/#2&,{m,sc}],rhs/sc];\nerrAbs=auditNorm[reco-psi,pr];errRel=errAbs/Norm[psi];hwerr=auditNorm[hb .(reco-psi),pr]/Norm[hb . psi];\nAppendTo[out,{mu,Length[sec],errAbs,errRel,hwerr,rr[[k]],Min[Precision/@reco]}];\nAppendTo[sts,<|\"mu\"->mu,\"eigenvalue\"->es[[1,k]],\"q\"->qq,\"tQ\"->tq,\"reconstructed\"->reco,\"reference\"->psi,\"sector\"->sec|>],\n{k,pick}],{mu,auditHWSectors}];\n<|\"epsilon\"->eps,\"precision\"->pr,\"h\"->hh,\"theta\"->ths,\"table\"->out,\"states\"->sts,\"BaxterResidualScaled\"->qres,\"transferCoefficientResidual\"->tres,\"overlapRelativeResidual\"->overres|>];\nauditPhi={1/3,-2/7,5/11}; auditOmegas={{2/5,1/7,-3/4},{-3/5,2/3,5/7},{4/7,-5/6,2/9}};\nauditSmall1=auditSmall[1/2,{2/7,-3/5},10^-6,240,auditPhi,auditOmegas];\nGrid[Join[{{\"mu\",\"weight dimension\",\"absolute vector residual\",\"relative vector residual\",\"relative HW residual\",\"HW residual of finite-twist target\",\"retained precision\"}},(Join[Take[#,2],N[Drop[#,2],5]]&/@auditSmall1[\"table\"]),{{\"Q overlap max relative residual\",N[auditSmall1[\"overlapRelativeResidual\"],5]},{\"Q-to-transfer coefficient residual\",N[auditSmall1[\"transferCoefficientResidual\"],5]},{\"scaled Baxter residual\",N[auditSmall1[\"BaxterResidualScaled\"],5]}}],Frame->All,Alignment->Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
