  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 13d. Symbolic proof of the four localization factors\n\nUndo the common upper-triangular physical rotation. The bra becomes $e_1^T\\otimes e_1^T$ and the auxiliary twist becomes $g^{-T}\\operatorname{diag}(z)g^T$, which is lower triangular. Prove the identities for an arbitrary lower-triangular twist with six independent entries, at $h=1,\\theta=(d,0)$. Translation and homogeneity then restore arbitrary $h,\\theta_1,\\theta_2$. This checks the entire polynomial identity, including the corrected $6h^4\\chi_3 f$ term.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "auditTRowM[m_,i_,j_,x_,hh_,ths_,gg_] := Expand[Sum[gg[[l,j]] Transpose[auditL[i,k,x-ths[[1]],hh]] . m . auditL[k,l,x-ths[[2]],hh],{k,3},{l,3}]];\nauditTrowM[m_,a_,x_,hh_,ths_,gg_] := Expand[Sum[Signature[pp] Fold[auditTRowM[#1,Sequence@@#2,hh,ths,gg]&,m,Table[{pp[[k]],ii[[k]],x-(k-1)hh},{k,a}]],{ii,Subsets[Range[3],{a}]},{pp,Permutations[ii]}]];\nauditOneM[i_,j_,x_,gg_] := Sum[auditL[i,l,x,1]gg[[l,j]],{l,3}];\nauditOneTM[a_,x_,gg_] := Expand[Sum[Signature[pp] Dot@@Table[auditOneM[pp[[k]],ii[[k]],x-k+1,gg],{k,a}],{ii,Subsets[Range[3],{a}]},{pp,Permutations[ii]}]];\nauditLower={{za,0,0},{ab,zb,0},{ac,bc,zc}};\nauditSeed=UnitVector[d1,1];auditSeed2=Outer[Times,auditSeed,auditSeed];\nauditSym11=auditTrowM[auditSeed2,2,dd-2,1,{dd,0},auditLower];\nauditSym21=auditTrowM[auditSym11,1,dd-1,1,{dd,0},auditLower]-auditQdet[{za,zb,zc},1,{dd,0},dd-1]auditSeed2;\nauditSymA=auditTrowM[auditSeed2,2,1,1,{dd,0},auditLower];\nauditSymB=auditTrowM[auditSymA,1,-1,1,{dd,0},auditLower];\nauditSymV11=auditSeed . auditOneTM[2,-2,auditLower];\nauditSymV21=auditSymV11 . auditOneTM[1,-1,auditLower]-auditSeed . auditOneTM[3,-1,auditLower];\nauditSymVA=auditSeed . auditOneTM[2,1,auditLower];\nauditSymVB=auditSymVA . auditOneTM[1,-1,auditLower];\nauditSymResiduals=Expand/@{auditSym11-(dd-1)(dd-3)Outer[Times,auditSymV11,auditSeed],\nauditSym21-(dd-1)^2(dd-3)Outer[Times,auditSymV21,auditSeed],\nauditSymA-(dd-1)(dd-3)Outer[Times,auditSeed,auditSymVA],\nauditSymB-Outer[Times,auditSeed,-(dd-1)^2(dd-3)auditSymVB+6 za zb zc(dd-1)(dd-3)auditSeed]};\nauditSymbolicProof=(Union[Flatten[Simplify[#]]] === {0}&)/@auditSymResiduals;\nGrid[Prepend[Transpose[{{\"site1 (1,1)\",\"site1 (2,1)\",\"site2 A\",\"site2 B\"},auditSymbolicProof}],{\"generic lower-triangular twist; symbolic d\",\"identically zero residual\"}],Frame->All,Alignment->Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758597\" data-output-id=\"364\" data-out-n=\"852\" data-sub-idx=\"16\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"101\" data-sub-start=\"19\" data-sub-end=\"19\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[852]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">generic lower-triangular twist; symbolic d</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">site1 (1,1)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">site1 (2,1)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">site2 A</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">site2 B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">identically zero residual</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[852]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{generic lower-triangular twist; symbolic d} & \\text{identically zero residual}\\\\\\hline\\text{site1 (1,1)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{site1 (2,1)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{site2 A} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{site2 B} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
