  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 13f. Verify the actual untwisted CG limit\n\nNormalize the Q-reconstructed vectors and compare with the untwisted transfer eigenbasis inside each exact highest-weight space. This tests the CG limit separately from finite-twist reconstruction. Both octet copies are matched by their overlaps, not by a potentially changing eigenvalue sort.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "auditLimitError[run_] := Module[{hh=run[\"h\"],ths=run[\"theta\"],tm,ans},\ntm=auditTransfer[{1,1,1},hh,ths,120];\nans=Table[With[{sec=st[\"sector\"],hb=N[auditHW[st[\"mu\"]],120]},Module[{es,targets,v,ov,ix,phase},\nes=Eigensystem[hb . (((tm[[1]]+N[Pi,120]tm[[2]])/.u->3/7)[[sec,sec]]) . Transpose[hb]];\ntargets=Normalize[# . hb]&/@es[[2]];v=Normalize[st[\"reconstructed\"]];ov=Conjugate[targets] . v;ix=First@Ordering[Abs[ov],-1];phase=Conjugate[ov[[ix]]]/Abs[ov[[ix]]];\n{st[\"mu\"],ix,auditNorm[phase v-targets[[ix]],100],Abs[ov[[ix]]]}]],{st,run[\"states\"]}];ans];\nauditLimit1=auditLimitError[auditSmall1];auditLimit2=auditLimitError[auditSmall2];auditLimit3=auditLimitError[auditSmall3];auditLimit4=auditLimitError[auditSmall4];\nauditLimitRows=MapThread[Join[Take[#1,2],{N[#1[[3]],5],N[#2[[3]],5],If[TrueQ[#2[[3]]==0],\"exact\",N[#1[[3]]/#2[[3]],5]]}]&,{auditLimit1,auditLimit3}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"mu\",\"untwisted branch\",\"CG direction error at 1e-6\",\"at 1e-9\",\"error ratio\"}},auditLimitRows,{{\"P2, alternate phi, max CG direction error at 1e-9\",N[Max[auditLimit4[[All,3]]],5]}}],Frame->All,Alignment->Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
