      {
       "data": "Out[860]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{mu} & \\text{untwisted branch} & \\text{CG direction error at 1e-6} & \\text{at 1e-9} & \\text{error ratio}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} & 1 & 0 & 0 & \\text{exact}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,1,1\\right\\} & 1 & 1.4276\\times 10^{-7} & 1.4276\\times 10^{-10} & 1000.00\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,3,0\\right\\} & 1 & 1.1939\\times 10^{-7} & 1.1939\\times 10^{-10} & 1000.00\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\} & 1 & 1.2064\\times 10^{-7} & 1.2064\\times 10^{-10} & 1000.0\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\} & 2 & 1.6865\\times 10^{-7} & 1.6865\\times 10^{-10} & 1000.0\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,2,2\\right\\} & 1 & 1.8649\\times 10^{-7} & 1.8649\\times 10^{-10} & 1000.00\\\\\\hline\\text{P2, alternate phi, max CG direction error at 1e-9} & 2.6384\\times 10^{-10} &  &  & \\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
