  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 13g. Audit ledger and scope\n\n**Established here:** all four localization factors are symbolic identities; the corrected site-2 scalar coefficient is $6h^4\\chi_3f$; three bra twists are generically sufficient and minimal for these four rows plus $x_0$; the reference-state determinant ratio eliminates $y_0$ and $c_0$; the complete Q-driven reconstruction passes at two chain points and two small-$\\varepsilon$ scales. The reconstructed normalized states converge to all six untwisted HW eigenstates, with $O(\\varepsilon)$ direction error.\n\n**Scope:** this validates the map from spectral Q-data to CG vectors. Test Q-data are obtained by solving Baxter equations using transfer eigenvalues from the test eigensystem. It is not an independent Q-only solver for the spectrum. No assertion is made that substituting a leading HW vector into a finite-twist overlap is valid; reconstruction is performed before taking the limit.\n\n**Rerun:** cells 3–14, then 90–108. Sections 5–12 are not dependencies. The historical summary in cells 88–89 includes old rejected approaches; the following ledger is the pass/fail summary for this audit.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "auditLedger={\n{\"generic triangular-twist localization\",\"symbolic identity\",And@@auditSymbolicProof},\n{\"three independent rational localization tests\",\"independently validated\",And@@auditLocalResults[[All,1]]},\n{\"original row-action implementation\",\"exact\",auditRowCross},\n{\"transfer coefficient templates\",\"exact\",auditTemplateCheck},\n{\"vacuum transfer formula\",\"exact\",auditVacCheck},\n{\"three w give full HW-weight ranks\",\"exact\",And@@(#[[2]]==#[[3]]&/@auditExactRanks)},\n{\"all 64 baseline Q overlaps\",\"60 digits; threshold 1e-40\",TrueQ[auditOverlapRel<10^-40]},\n{\"all 64 baseline Q reconstructions\",\"60 digits; threshold 1e-40\",TrueQ[Max[auditReconstructionRel]<10^-40]},\n{\"six branches in each small-twist run\",\"independently validated\",And@@(Length[#[\"states\"]]==6&/@auditRuns)},\n{\"small-twist relative reconstruction error\",\"160-300 digits; threshold 1e-70\",TrueQ[Max[auditRunSummary[[All,6]]]<10^-70]},\n{\"Q-only overlap residuals\",\"160-300 digits; threshold 1e-80\",TrueQ[Max[auditRunSummary[[All,7]]]<10^-80]},\n{\"Q-to-transfer coefficient residuals\",\"160-300 digits; threshold 1e-100\",TrueQ[Max[auditRunSummary[[All,8]]]<10^-100]},\n{\"160 vs 240 digit stability\",\"relative threshold 1e-70\",TrueQ[auditPrecisionAgreement<10^-70]},\n{\"untwisted CG limit at epsilon 1e-9\",\"direction error below 3e-10\",TrueQ[Max[Join[auditLimit3[[All,3]],auditLimit4[[All,3]]]]<3 10^-10]},\n{\"CG convergence is first order\",\"non-top branches; error ratio 1000\",Max[Abs[auditLimit1[[2;;,3]]/auditLimit3[[2;;,3]]/1000-1]]<10^-5}\n};\nGrid[Join[{{\"check\",\"evidence / tolerance\",\"PASS\"}},auditLedger,{{\"passed\",Count[auditLedger[[All,3]],True],Length[auditLedger]}}],Frame->All,Alignment->Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
