  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 14. Independent spectral input from polynomial Baxter equations\n\nSection 13 supplied test Q's from physical transfer eigenvalues. Here the unknowns are the monic dual Q coefficients and the remaining transfer eigenvalue coefficients. The leading transfer coefficients are fixed by the twist, inhomogeneities and weight. Solve the polynomial Baxter identities directly, without a physical-space eigensystem or initial guesses from one. Start at h=1, theta=(5/2,0), z=(2,3,5); compare with the physical model only after solving.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Spectral equations contain no physical generators, transfer matrices, or eigenvectors. *)\nspecAnsatz[mu_,zz_,hh_,ths_] := Module[{qv,tv,qq,tt,eq},\nqv=Flatten[Table[Table[sq[j,k],{k,0,mu[[j]]-1}],{j,3}]];tv={st[1],st[2],st[3],st[4]};\nqq=Table[X^mu[[j]]+Sum[sq[j,k]X^k,{k,0,mu[[j]]-1}],{j,3}];\ntt={Total[zz]u^2+(hh zz . mu-Total[ths]Total[zz])u+st[1],\nTotal[Times@@zz[[#]]&/@Subsets[Range[3],{2}]]u^4+\nSum[(Times@@zz[[ii]])(hh(Total[mu[[ii]]]-2)-2 Total[ths]),{ii,Subsets[Range[3],{2}]}]u^3+\nst[2]u^2+st[3]u+st[4],auditQdet[zz,hh,ths,u]};\neq=DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Expand[auditOp[tt,qq[[j]],zz[[j]],1,hh,ths,X]],X],{j,3}]]],0];\n<|\"mu\"->mu,\"q\"->qq,\"t\"->tt,\"variables\"->Join[tv,qv],\"equations\"->eq|>];\nspecPoint={1,{5/2,0},{2,3,5}};\nspecSystems=Association@Table[ToString[mu,InputForm]->specAnsatz[mu,specPoint[[3]],specPoint[[1]],specPoint[[2]]],{mu,auditHWSectors}];\nspecSolutions=<||>;specTimes=<||>;\nDo[With[{key=ToString[mu,InputForm]},Module[{sys=specSystems[key],tim,res},\n{tim,res}=AbsoluteTiming[TimeConstrained[NSolve[Thread[specSystems[key][\"equations\"]==0],specSystems[key][\"variables\"],WorkingPrecision->80],40,$Aborted]];\nspecSolutions[key]=res;specTimes[key]=tim;Print[\"Baxter-only sector \",mu,\": \",If[ListQ[res],Length[res],\"time limit\"],\" solutions in \",N[tim,3],\" s.\"]]],{mu,auditHWSectors}];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{key,Length[specSystems[key][\"variables\"]],Length[specSystems[key][\"equations\"]],If[ListQ[specSolutions[key]],Length[specSolutions[key]],specSolutions[key]],specTimes[key]},{key,Keys[specSolutions]}],{\"weight\",\"unknowns\",\"equations\",\"solutions\",\"seconds\"}],Frame->All,Alignment->Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">Baxter-only sector </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRcezQsMiwwXHJpZ2h0XH0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">: </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-latex-b64=\"MQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> solutions in </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-latex-b64=\"MC4wNTUxNjI=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.055162</span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> s.</span></div></div><div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">Baxter-only sector </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"7\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRcezQsMSwxXHJpZ2h0XH0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><s