  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 14b. Reconstruct the complete spectrum without diagonalization\n\nSolve all 19 weight sectors from the Baxter polynomial equations. Reconstruct all states using the determinant ratio and three bra twists. Only after this do we build the physical transfer matrices, to test the eigenvector equations coefficient by coefficient. No physical eigensystem is used at any stage of this test.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Independent polynomial Newton refinement, seeded only by NSolve's Baxter roots. *)\nspecNewton[sys_,sr_,pr_] := Module[{vars=sys[\"variables\"],eq=sys[\"equations\"],jac,xx,vs,jv,ev,rs,delta,wp=pr+80},\njac=Transpose[Table[D[eq,var],{var,vars}]];xx=SetPrecision[vars/.sr,wp];\nDo[vs=Map[Max[1,Abs[#]]&,xx];jv=N[jac/.Thread[vars->xx],wp];ev=N[eq/.Thread[vars->xx],wp];\nrs=Map[Max[1,Max[Abs[#]]]&,jv . DiagonalMatrix[vs]];\ndelta=LeastSquares[MapThread[#1/#2&,{jv . DiagonalMatrix[vs],rs}],-ev/rs];\nxx=SetPrecision[xx+vs delta,wp],{4}];\nThread[vars->N[xx,pr]]];\nspecSolve[mu_,zz_,hh_,ths_,pr_] := Module[{sys=specAnsatz[mu,zz,hh,ths],sol},\nsol=NSolve[Thread[sys[\"equations\"]==0],sys[\"variables\"],WorkingPrecision->pr];\nsol=specNewton[sys,#,pr]&/@sol;\nTable[<|\"mu\"->mu,\"q\"->(sys[\"q\"]/.sr),\"t\"->(sys[\"t\"]/.sr),\"BaxterResidual\"->Max[Abs[N[sys[\"equations\"]/.Rationalize[sr,0],pr]]]|>,{sr,sol}]];\nspecReconstruct[data_,zz0_,hh_,ths_,ws0_,pr_] := Module[{zz=N[zz0,pr],ws=N[ws0,pr],topq,vqs,x0,mat},\ntopq=Table[auditMonicQ[N[auditVac[zz,hh,ths],pr],zz[[j]],1,{4,2,0}[[j]],hh,ths,pr],{j,3}];\nvqs=Table[Table[auditMonicQ[N[auditVac[ww,hh,ths],pr],ww[[j]],-1,2(j-1),hh,ths,pr],{j,3}],{ww,ws}];\nx0=auditX0[zz];mat=Append[Flatten[Table[auditRows[zz,ww,hh,ths],{ww,ws}],1],x0];\nTable[Module[{sec=Flatten[Position[wtBasis,stt[\"mu\"]]],ov,rhs,m,sc,v},\nov=MapThread[auditQOverlap[stt[\"q\"],topq,#1,zz,#2,hh,ths,pr]&,{vqs,ws}];\nrhs=Append[Flatten[Table[ov[[j]]auditEigenRows[stt[\"t\"],hh,ths],{j,Length[ws]}]],1];\nm=mat[[All,sec]];sc=Norm/@m;v=LeastSquares[MapThread[#1/#2&,{m,sc}],rhs/sc];\nJoin[stt,<|\"sector\"->sec,\"reconstructed\"->v,\"normalized\"->Normalize[v],\"dataResidual\"->auditNorm[m . v-rhs,pr]/Max[1,Norm[rhs]]|>]],{stt,data}]];\n(* Only this validation function builds two-site transfer matrices; no Eigensystem is needed. *)\nspecValidate[reco_,zz_,hh_,ths_,pr_] := Module[{tm=auditTransfer[zz,hh,ths,pr+40],x0=auditX0[N[zz,pr+40]]},\nTable[With[{sec=stt[\"sector\"],v=Rationalize[stt[\"reconstructed\"],0],tt=Rationalize[stt[\"t\"],0]},\n{stt[\"mu\"],stt[\"BaxterResidual\"],stt[\"dataResidual\"],Max[Table[auditNorm[Flatten[CoefficientList[Expand[tm[[a,sec,sec]] . v-tt[[a]]v],u]],pr]/Norm[v],{a,2}]],Abs[x0[[sec]] . v-1]}],{stt,reco}]];\nspecWeights=Union[wtBasis];\n{specAllTime,specAllData}=AbsoluteTiming[Flatten[Table[specSolve[mu,specPoint[[3]],specPoint[[1]],specPoint[[2]],100],{mu,specWeights}],1]];\nspecAllVectors=specReconstruct[specAllData,specPoint[[3]],specPoint[[1]],specPoint[[2]],{{7/3,11/4,4/7},{9/4,13/5,3/7},{12/5,17/6,5/8}},100];\nspecAllValidation=specValidate[specAllVectors,specPoint[[3]],specPoint[[1]],specPoint[[2]],100];\nspecAllCounts=Table[{mu,Count[specAllData,a_/;a[\"mu\"]==mu],Count[wtBasis,mu]},{mu,specWeights}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"weight\",\"Baxter solutions\",\"physical weight dimension\"}},specAllCounts,{{\"total states\",Length[specAllData]},{\"spectral solve time (s)\",specAllTime},{\"max Baxter equation residual\",N[Max[specAllValidation[[All,2]]],5]},{\"max reconstruction data residual\",N[Max[specAllValidation[[All,3]]],5]},{\"max transfer eigenvector residual / vector norm\",N[Max[specAllValidation[[All,4]]],5]},{\"max normalization residual\",N[Max[specAllValidation[[All,5]]],5]}}],Frame->All,Alignment->Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
