  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 14c. Baxter-only small-twist CG reconstruction\n\nUse the exact rational path z=1+epsilon phi and w=1+epsilon omega, so polynomial elimination operates over exact rational coefficients. Its first-order twist direction is the same as the exponential path. Solve every state in the five HW-weight sectors, reconstruct them, then select the six branches whose raising-operator residual tends to zero. Physical transfer matrices and the untwisted HW eigensystem appear only in the subsequent verification.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "specNear[hh_,ths_,eps_,pr_,ph_] := Module[{zz=1+eps ph,wws=(1+eps #)&/@auditOmegas,data,reco,valid,hw,hwres,solvetime},\n{solvetime,data}=AbsoluteTiming[Flatten[Table[specSolve[mu,zz,hh,ths,pr],{mu,auditHWSectors}],1]];\nreco=specReconstruct[data,zz,hh,ths,wws,pr];valid=specValidate[reco,zz,hh,ths,pr];\nhwres[stt_]:=With[{sec=stt[\"sector\"],v=stt[\"normalized\"]},Norm[Join[(E1[1,2]+E2[1,2])[[All,sec]] . v,(E1[2,3]+E2[2,3])[[All,sec]] . v]]];\nhw=Flatten[Table[Take[SortBy[Select[reco,#[\"mu\"]==mu&],hwres],Length[auditHW[mu]]],{mu,auditHWSectors}],1];\n<|\"h\"->hh,\"theta\"->ths,\"epsilon\"->eps,\"precision\"->pr,\"spectralTime\"->solvetime,\"allStates\"->reco,\"states\"->hw,\"validation\"->valid,\"hwResidual\"->Max[hwres/@hw]|>];\nspecNear1=specNear[1/2,{2/7,-3/5},10^-6,200,auditPhi];\nspecNear2=specNear[1/2,{2/7,-3/5},10^-9,280,auditPhi];\nspecNear3=specNear[1/3,{1/5,-4/9},10^-9,280,{-2/5,3/8,7/11}];\nspecNearLimits=auditLimitError/@{specNear1,specNear2,specNear3};\nspecNearSummary=MapThread[{#1[\"h\"],#1[\"epsilon\"],#1[\"precision\"],Length[#1[\"allStates\"]],Length[#1[\"states\"]],Max[#1[\"validation\"][[All,2]]],Max[#1[\"validation\"][[All,4]]],Max[#2[[All,3]]],#1[\"spectralTime\"]}&,{{specNear1,specNear2,specNear3},specNearLimits}];\nGrid[Join[{{\"h\",\"epsilon\",\"digits\",\"Baxter states\",\"HW branches\",\"Baxter coefficient residual\",\"physical eigenvector residual\",\"CG-limit direction error\",\"spectral solve seconds\"}},(Join[Take[#,5],N[Drop[#,5],5]]&/@specNearSummary)],Frame->All,Alignment->Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
